End

DESC:MTFUJIVIEWINGTOWER
	"The Emperor Yoshiro overlooks his palace grounds from within this ancient viewing tower."
End

DESC:MTRUSHMORE
	"Something is not right with the stern countenances of America's great leaders..."
End

DESC:MULTIPLAYERBEACON
	"Draws teammates' attention. Click the bubble to add a message. Remove by pressing Delete."
End

DESC:NAVYQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all Navy unit production."
End

DESC:NAVYSUBTAB
	"Manage individual Navy production structures."
End

DESC:NAVYTAB
	"Manage all Navy build queues."
End

DESC:NONGARRISONABLESTRUCTURE
	"From a tactical point of view, whatever this is, it can be destroyed if it gets in the way."
End

DESC:NY_NYSTOCKEXCHANGE
	"Send a Combat Engineer into this facility to force its proprietors share their wealth."
End

DESC:OBJECTIVES
	"Review mission objectives and more!"
End

DESC:OBSERVATIONPOSTTECHBUILDING
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer to reveal much of the surrounding battlefield!"
End

DESC:ODESSACASTLE
	"Soviet citizens cherish this quaint little fort, which has stood for nearly a century."
End

DESC:ODESSACHURCH
	"The Soviets' prayers shall go unanswered once Tatsu's ultimate weapon is finished with it."
End

DESC:ODESSAOPERA
	"The Soviet choir will be singing a different tune once Tatsu's ultimate weapon arrives."
End

DESC:OPENADVANCEDCOMMANDS
	"Display the full range of stances and orders available."
End

DESC:OPENPLAYERTECHSTORE
	"Spend Security Points earned in battle on a variety of useful military maneuvers!"
End

DESC:OPENSTANCES
	"Units all have a stance, which determines their default behavior when not under your control."
End

DESC:ORIGINALDOCKS
	"All of the Rising Sun's armadas are coordinated from these ancient facilities."
End

DESC:ORIGINALDOJO
	"This is the Empire of the Rising Sun's oldest, most important infantry training center."
End

DESC:PAUSEBUTTON
	"Open the Mission Menu to review objectives, adjust settings, take a break from battle, and more."
End

DESC:PILOTSNIPESPECIALPOWER
	"Cleanly dispatches the operator of an enemy vehicle. Infantry may recover the vehicle."
End

DESC:PLANNINGMODE
	"Use Planning Mode to give coordinated commands to multiple units--useful for two-pronged attacks.\n\nLeft-click icon then issue a sequence of commands as needed.\n\nLeft-click icon again to make units execute the plan."
End

DESC:PLAYERCONTROLGROUPS
	"Select all units assigned to this control group. To set a group, select units, hold LB, and hold the X button."
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERAIRPOWER
	"Improve durability, scan range, ammo capacity and reload times of the Allies' mighty aircraft!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERALLIEDFREETRADE
	"Earn more credits for each ore load, improving the efficiency of all of your Prospectors!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCHRONORIFTLVL1
	"Make everything in the vicinity of this scientific anomaly simply vanish for a short while!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCHRONORIFTLVL2
	"Make everything in a wide vicinity of this scientific anomaly simply vanish for a while!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCHRONORIFTLVL3
	"Make everything in a large area around this scientific anomaly vanish for quite some time!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCHRONOSPHERE
	"Matter-transport target units to any other point in the field! Caution: Deadly to infantry."
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCHRONOSWAP
	"Cause any two of your units to switch places instantly! Think of the possibilities!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCRUSHPUPPIES
	"Enhance crushing vehicles with treads that repair hull damage as they run over foes!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCRYOSATELLITELVL1
	"Put units and structures in the area on ice for a short while, making them highly vulnerable!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCRYOSATELLITELVL2
	"Put units and structures in a wide area on ice for a while, making them highly vulnerable!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERCRYOSATELLITELVL3
	"Put units and structures in a huge area on ice for quite a while, making them highly vulnerable!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERDESOLATORBOMB_LEVEL1
	"Order a Badger Bomber to drop a deadly bushel that harms any forces lingering in the area!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERDESOLATORBOMB_LEVEL2
	"Order two Badger Bombers to drop deadly bushels that harm any forces lingering in the area!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERDESOLATORBOMB_LEVEL3
	"Order three Badger Bombers to drop deadly bushels that harm any forces lingering in the area!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERFINALSQUADRON_L1
	"Call a group of Sunburst Drone Fighters to descend upon the target area in a climatic strike!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERFINALSQUADRON_L2
	"Call a flurry of Sunburst Drone Fighters to descend upon the target area in a climatic strike!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERFINALSQUADRON_L3
	"Call a torrent of Sunburst Drone Fighters to descend upon the target area in a climatic strike!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERHIGHTECHNOLOGY
	"Power up the special abilities of your Dogs, Guardian Tanks, Cryocopters, and Carriers!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERIRONCURTAIN
	"Enclose targets in an impervious (yet short-lasting) force-shield! Happens to kill infantry."
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERIRRADIATETARGET
	"Befoul a sacrificial vehicle, causing it to leak vile toxins that foes had best avoid!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANADVANCEDMISSILEPACKS
	"Arm your rocket-spewing forces with even more rapid, swirling warheads of chaotic destruction!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANAMBUSH
	"Order well-rested Tankbusters to emerge from subterranean hiding precisely where needed!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANBALLOONATTACK_L1
	"Deliver a respectable payload of slowly-falling bombs to your enemies! Guidable in midair!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANBALLOONATTACK_L2
	"Deliver a sizable payload of slowly-falling bombs to your enemies! Guidable in midair!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANBALLOONATTACK_L3
	"Deliver a massive payload of slowly-falling bombs to your enemies! Guidable in midair!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANEMPERORSRESOLVE_L1
	"Inspire units to attack with more ferocity while slowing their gait for a brief while!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANEMPERORSRESOLVE_L2
	"Inspire units to attack with great ferocity while slowing their gait considerably for a while!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANEMPERORSRESOLVE_L3
	"Inspire units to attack with unbridled ferocity while slowing nearly to a stop for a while!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANENHANCEDKAMIKAZE
	"Strap your forces with avenging explosives that detonate when critical damage is sustained!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANNAVALPOWER
	"Reinforce your naval vessels with greater top speeds, sturdier hulls, and superior scanners!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERJAPANROBOTICASSEMBLY
	"Bolsters all production structures with special nanomachines that reduce build times!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERMAGNETICSATELLITELVL1
	"Suck certain armored units into space with a guidable tractor beam! Try it with Orbital Drop!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERMAGNETICSATELLITELVL2
	"Suck certain armored units into space with a powerful tractor beam! Try it with Orbital Drop!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERMAGNETICSATELLITELVL3
	"Suck armored units into space with a fast, powerful tractor beam! Try it with Orbital Drop!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERMAGNETICSINGULARITY
	"Cause a magnetic disturbance in an area, which drags vehicles helplessly towards it!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERNANOSWARMHIVE
	"Form an impregnable hemisphere of tiny robots over the target area, barring passage in or out!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERORBITALREFUSE_RANK1
	"Decommission a space probe to come crashing down on cue, along with other orbital refuse!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERORBITALREFUSE_RANK2
	"Decommission a satellite to come crashing down on cue, along with other orbital refuse!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERORBITALREFUSE_RANK3
	"Decommission a space station to come crashing down on cue, along with other orbital refuse!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERPARTICLECANNON
	"Engulf the target area in a boiling bath of energy that chain-reacts to any targets near ground zero!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERPOINTDEFENSEDRONES
	"Bolster your precious vehicles with these selfless hoverdrones, which absorb incoming fire!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERPRECISIONSTRIKE
	"Call in an Artemis Precision Bomber to take a big chunk out of the target of your choice!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERPRODUCTIONKICKBACKS
	"Earn credits when designated targets are destroyed! The bounty expires, so act fast!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERSATELLITESWEEP
	"See what your enemies are hiding! Select two points on the map to sweep along that line!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERSOVIETMASSPRODUCTION
	"Build units at a reduced cost, thanks to carefully-renegotiated defensive contracts!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERTELEKINETICPROJECTORDEVICE
	"Unleash immeasurable violent psionic energy upon the target area for devastating results!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERTERRORDRONEEGGS
	"Cause Terror Drones to occasionally burst forth from the remains of your vehicles!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERTIMEBOMBLVL1
	"Materialize a short-fused, explosive package at the designated point!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERTIMEBOMBLVL2
	"Materialize a short-fused, extremely explosive package at the designated point!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERTIMEBOMBLVL3
	"Materialize a short-fused, unbelievably explosive package at the designated point!"
End

DESC:PLAYERPOWERVACUUMBOMB
	"Obliterate your enemies in a warhead detonation that sucks everything in, then blows it away!"
End

