End

DESC:PORTSTRUCTURE
	"If a Spy gets inside one of these, he can rig an explosive surprise for the Soviets."
End

DESC:POWERSTAB
	"Use Top-Secret Protocols granted by High Command, or use any available Superweapons."
End

DESC:PRESIDENTLIMO
	"President Ackerman's private limousine, furnished with supple leather interior and a full bar."
End

