DESC:RADARLOCKSPECIALPOWER
	"Makes missiles hit faster and harder, though the launcher takes longer to get a target lock."
End

DESC:RADARLOCKSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Reverts back to the standard missile config, which offers faster target locking."
End

DESC:RANDOMCRATE
	"One can only guess what wonders lie inside this securely-sealed supply container."
End

DESC:RAPIDLAUNCHSPECIALPOWER
	"Pushes rocket launchers past safety limits for faster firing--and internal damage."
End

DESC:RAPIDLAUNCHSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Gives up the faster rate of fire to stop internal meltdowns from causing further damage."
End

DESC:REPAIRMODE
	"Spend credits to repair damaged structures.\n\nLeft-click icon then left-click on target structure."
End

DESC:REPAIRMODECONSOLE
	"Initiate repairs on designated structures, which costs credits over time."
End

DESC:REVERSEMOVE
	"Selected vehicles will move backwards to target location, if they can--useful for some defensive tactics.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target location."
End

DESC:ROARSPECIALPOWER
	"Paralyzes nearby enemy infantry with a deafening war cry. Also tenderizes meat."
End

DESC:RUSHMOREFIRINGBASE
	"Suffice it to say, this structure must be destroyed before the President's limo arrives."
End

DESC:RUSHMOREHEADCONTROLCENTER_JEFFERSON
	"Capture this facility with an Engineer to deactivate the bust of Jefferson."
End

DESC:RushmoreHeadControlCenter_Lincoln
	"Capture this facility with an Engineer to deactivate the bust of Abe Lincoln."
End

DESC:RushmoreHeadControlCenter_Washington
	"Capture this facility with an Engineer to deactivate the bust of Washington."
End

DESC:RUSHMORERADARTOWER
	"This antenna enables remote access to the defensive network here at Mt. Rushmore."
End

DESC:S08SpecialCarrier
	"The emissary aboard this carrier naïvely volunteered to treat with the Premier's men."
End

DESC:S08SpecialDreadnought
	"The ambassador aboard this ship has confidential orders directly from the Premier."
End

DESC:SA_BESTBUY
	"Capture this unassuming retail store with an Engineer for a steady influx of credits!"
End

DESC:SA_GAME
	"Capture this unassuming retail store with an Engineer for a steady influx of credits!"
End

DESC:SA_GAMESTOP
	"Capture this unassuming retail store with an Engineer for a steady influx of credits!"
End

DESC:SA_OBSERVATORYDEFENSIVEGUN
	"Devastating long-range artillery by day, observatory by night. Approach with caution."
End

DESC:SANTAMONICAPIER
	"Civilians used these contraptions to leave their worries behind before the war came."
End

DESC:SATELLITELAUNCHFACILITY
	"Reactivating this old satellite launch facility should bring orbital defenses back online."
End

DESC:SELLMODE
	"Sell a structure for an instant refund based on the structure's condition.\n\nLeft-click icon then left-click on target structure."
End

DESC:SELLMODECONSOLE
	"Sell designated structures for an instant refund in credits."
End

DESC:SHIPYARDTECHSTRUCTURE
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and all your navy units will automatically self-repair!"
End

DESC:SHROUDCRATE
	"Order a unit onto this unassuming device to suddenly reveal the surrounding area."
End

DESC:SMOKEBOMBSPECIALPOWER
	"Vanishes in a puff of smoke, causing enemy assailants to lose their target in bewilderment."
End

DESC:SOVIETAIRFIELD
	"As Soviet air power grew, these facilities became necessary for maintaining various aircraft."
End

DESC:SOVIETAIRFIELDRETURNTOBASE
	"Orders any aircraft that were docked at this Airfield to return to base immediately."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIAIRSHIP
	"All-terrain transports boasting highly-effective AA guns and unorthodox ejection systems."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIGROUNDAIRCRAFT
	"Combat helicopters armed to the teeth with guns and rockets. Can haul troops or vehicles."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIINFANTRYINFANTRY
	"Young frontliners armed with assault rifles, promises of glory, and explosive cocktails."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIINFANTRYVEHICLE
	"Rickety mechanical walkers that can engage multiple hostiles with their triple machine guns."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTINAVYSHIPTECH1
	"Insulated, lightly armored vessels armed with electrifying Tesla weapons. Can clamber ashore."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTINAVYSHIPTECH2
	"Hidden killers that surface only to fire. Nothing can withstand their torpedoes for long."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTISTRUCTURESHIP
	"The big brothers of the Red Navy, these massive siege ships host an array of V4 rockets."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTISTRUCTUREVEHICLE
	"Mobile long-range ballistic-rocket platforms that can level a city block with one launch."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIVEHICLEINFANTRY
	"Burly convicts forced to carry heavy anti-air flak cannons and satchels of volatile mines."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH1
	"Sturdy main battle tanks that symbolize the Red Army. Can siphon armor from their enemies."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH2
	"Heavily-armored behemoths fitted with a pair of Tesla Coils, which can slag vehicles in a flash."
End

DESC:SOVIETANTIVEHICLEVEHICLETECH3
	"Monstrous self-repairing tanks that can run over anything their ferocious cannons let live."
End

DESC:SOVIETBARRACKS
	"All Soviet infantry are trained, sometimes hastily, at modest facilities such as this."
End

DESC:SOVIETBASEDEFENSEADVANCED
	"Ominous, lightning-shooting towers. May be powered by Tesla Troopers or Stingrays."
End

DESC:SOVIETBASEDEFENSEAIR
	"Rapid-fire air defense cannons that fill the skies with a hailstorm of metal shards."
End

DESC:SOVIETBASEDEFENSEGROUND
	"Heavy machine gun nests manned by Soviet conscripts relegated to guard duty."
End

DESC:SOVIETBOMBERAIRCRAFT
	"Fearsome war-zeppelins boasting self-sealing armor and vast stores of heavy iron bombs."
End

DESC:SOVIETBOMBERAIRCRAFT_SPECIAL
	"A Kirov armed with but one gargantuan bomb, intended for an unsuspecting Allied city."
End

DESC:SOVIETBUNKER
	"Infantry may shoot from out of this makeshift bunker, which affords them some protection."
End

DESC:SOVIETCOMMANDOTECH1
	"Spitting image of a ruthless, legendary markswoman. Authorized to call airstrikes."
End

DESC:SOVIETCONSTRUCTIONYARD
	"Heart of any Soviet base. They assemble military structures and may pack up into MCVs."
End

DESC:SOVIETCRANE
	"Industrial cranes used to construct structures and repair vehicles--or scrap them for cash."
End

DESC:SOVIETENGINEER
	"Grizzled, pistol-packing men of science who can capture or repair structures."
End

DESC:SOVIETFIGHTERAIRCRAFT
	"Sleek and elusive jetfighters that can pulverize enemy squadrons with their burst-missiles."
End

DESC:SOVIETFIGHTERAIRCRAFTRETURNTOAIRFIELD
	"Causes the MiG Fighter to immediately turn tail and double back to an Airfield to rearm."
End

DESC:SOVIETHEAVYANTIVEHICLEINFANTRY
	"Heavily-armored, lightning-shooting bruisers who can go toe-to-toe with enemy tanks."
End

DESC:SOVIETMCV
	"Heavily-armored, self-powered production vehicles used to push the front lines."
End

DESC:SOVIETMINER
	"Simple armored vehicles that gather raw resources with which to fuel the Soviet War Machine."
End

DESC:SOVIETNAVALYARD
	"These structures are authorized to build and maintain any class of vessel in the Soviet navy."
End

DESC:SOVIETOUTPOST
	"The Soviets tend to expand their sprawling bases around these operations hubs."
End

DESC:SOVIETPOWERPLANT
	"Soviet facilities and base defenses require considerable power, which Reactors provide."
End

DESC:SOVIETPOWERPLANTADVANCED
	"Symbolic of Soviet excesses, these dangerously volatile structures could fuel a city."
End

DESC:SOVIETRADARDISH
	"Radar Dishes enables the tactical minimap feature of the Battlefield Control interface."
End

DESC:SOVIETREFINERY
	"Ore Collectors toil between these and ore gathering points, filling Soviet coffers."
End

DESC:SOVIETSCOUTINFANTRY
	"Savage beasts trained in close-quarters combat and recon. Enemy disguises can't trick them."
End

DESC:SOVIETSCOUTVEHICLE
	"Unsettling little combat robots that can bore into flesh or metal. Waterproof up to 100 meters."
End

DESC:SovietStatue
	"People of the Union pay their respects to such lifeless idols, rather than to the Empire."
End

DESC:SOVIETSUPERWEAPON
	"Emits a strange kinetic barrier that makes targets invulnerable, briefly. Lethal to infantry."
End

DESC:SOVIETSUPERWEAPONADVANCED
	"Soviet scientists laughed aside ethical concerns while inventing this monstrous warhead."
End

DESC:SOVIETSURVEYOR
	"Smaller and humbler than MCVs, these unarmed vehicles can set up expansion bases."
End

DESC:SOVIETTECHSTRUCTURE
	"These unlock the latest weapons while silently analyzing combat data for future use."
End

DESC:SOVIETVIPBUNKER
	"A high-ranking Soviet commander is inside this facility, personally supervising the mission."
End

DESC:SOVIETWALLPIECE
	"Two wall pieces placed in an unbroken row will form a thick barrier that blocks enemies."
End

DESC:SOVIETWARFACTORY
	"The infamous Soviet tank divisions and other vehicles are built from these facilities."
End

DESC:ST_LENINGRADMISSLEBASE
	"From a tactical point of view, whatever this is, it can be destroyed if it gets in the way."
End

DESC:ST_LENINGRADMISSLEBASE_01
	"Not only is this museum educational, it contains rocket launchers. An Engineer could operate them."
End

DESC:ST_SHUTTLEBUILDING
	"A symbol of the Soviet Union, this proud fortress houses countless cultural treasures."
End

DESC:STOP
	"Selected units will cease performing any command they were given and resume acting based on their stance.\n\nLeft-click icon to stop units."
End

DESC:SUPERTORPEDOSSPECIALPOWER
	"Launches a pair of unguided high-yield torpedoes to smash into anything dead ahead."
End

DESC:SUPPORTQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all Support Structure build queues, for making base defenses, walls, and superweapons."
End

DESC:SUPPORTSTRUCTURESUBTAB
	"Manage individual Support Structure build queues."
End

DESC:SUPPORTSTRUCTURETAB
	"Manage all Support Structure build queues."
End

DESC:TECHBUILDINGOILDERRICK
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and it will provide you with a steady flow of income!"
End

DESC:TECHBUILDINGORENODE
	"Provides precious raw materials suitable for military funding on a first-come, first-served basis."
End

DESC:TECHBUILDINGORENODE2
	"Provides raw materials suitable for efficient military production. Room enough for two Collectors!"
End

DESC:TECHBUILDINGORENODE4
	"Provides raw materials suitable for efficient military production. Room enough for four Collectors!"
End

DESC:TECHBUILDINGPOWERPLANT
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and enjoy the boost to your base's energy reserves. Smooth!"
End

DESC:TECHSTORETAB
	"Spend Security Points earned in battle on a variety of useful military maneuvers!"
End

DESC:TESLANOVASPECIALPOWER
	"Jolts surrounding waters with intense electrical current, briefly disabling the Stingray."
End

DESC:THREATMETER
	"A highly-scientific measure of chaos and destruction over time.\n\nThe higher the Threat Level, the faster you earn Security Points and your units gain veterancy."
End

DESC:TIMEBELTSPECIALPOWER
	"Snaps Tanya back several moments in time ago using her one-of-a-kind belt buckle."
End

DESC:TOGGLEAFTERBURNERS
	"Yields more-respectable top speeds as unstable chemicals eat away at overall hull integrity."
End

DESC:TOGGLEAFTERBURNERSOFF
	"Reverts to standard slow-and-ominous speed and stops taking damage from chemical burn."
End

DESC:TOGGLEARMORUP
	"Deploys special ceramic armor, which also reduces speed and covers the cargo hold."
End

DESC:TOGGLEARMORUPOFF
	"Folds up the anti-tank armor, regaining mobility and the ability to carry out ore gathering."
End

DESC:TOGGLEBINARYWEAPON
	"Switches from its primary attack mode to an immobilizing ray that stops enemy vehicles."
End

DESC:TOGGLEBINARYWEAPONOFF
	"Switches to the dismantler claws, which can bore into enemy combatants."
End

DESC:TOGGLELEECHBEAM
	"Switches to using the Leech-Beam, which siphons armor and weapons from target vehicles."
End

DESC:TOGGLELEECHBEAMOFF
	"Switches to the 85 mm autoloading cannon, along with any leeched secondary weapon."
End

DESC:TOGGLELOCKDOWNGUNSPECIALPOWER
	"Switches from photon rockets to the Paralysis Whip, which locks down surface targets."
End

DESC:TOGGLELOCKDOWNGUNSPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Switches to the photon rocket array, which overwhelms targets with countless warheads."
End

DESC:TOGGLERIOTSHIELDUPGRADE
	"Switches to using a bulletproof shield, which can make it easier to get up nice and close."
End

DESC:TOGGLERIOTSHIELDUPGRADEOFF
	"Switches to the Grummond-8 pump shotgun, which is effective in close-quarters combat."
End

DESC:TOGGLESHIELDSPHERE
	"Generates an emergency energy barrier to temporarily repel incoming fire."
End

DESC:TOGGLESPIDERHOLE
	"Escapes into a spider hole for increased protection and to avoid being crushed."
End

DESC:TOGGLESPIDERHOLEOFF
	"Backs out of the spider hole to resume fighting like a man. Regain honor when possible."
End

DESC:TORPEDOSPREADSPECIALPOWER
	"Launches a fanlike spread of ship-killing warheads, held in concealed secondary launchers."
End

DESC:UNITCRATE
	"A crate that spawns a unit when collected."
End

DESC:UNITINTRO
	"Watch a quick video showing off the selected unit's primary and special abilities."
End

DESC:UNITSMENUTAB
	"Manage your currently selected units or structure."
End

DESC:VARIABLEWEAPONTRANSFORMOFF2
	"Switch to anti-surface configuration and heavily deter enemy infantry by means of death."
End

DESC:VEHICLEGROUP
	"Select all vehicles in the field."
End

DESC:VEHICLEQUEUECONSOLE
	"Manage all ground-based Vehicle build queues."
End

DESC:VEHICLESUBTAB
	"Manage individual Vehicle production structures."
End

DESC:VEHICLETAB
	"Manage all Vehicle build queues."
End

DESC:VETERANCYCRATE
	"Order a unit to get this helpful, conveniently-situated device to raise its experience level."
End

DESC:VETERANCYTECHSTRUCTURE
	"Capture this structure with an Engineer and all your units will start with veteran rank!"
End

DESC:VOICECHATMODE
	"Chatting to Allies vs. Chatting to All"
End

DESC:VOICECHATMODEALL
	"Currently chatting to all Players"
End

DESC:VOICECHATMODEALLIES
	"Currently chatting to only Allies"
End

DESC:VOICECHATMODESPECIFIC
	"This icon indicates you are currently broadcasting your voice stream to other players"
End

DESC:VOLCANOFORTRESS
	"The scheming and paranoid Premier Cherdenko is holed up inside this diabolical fortress."
End

DESC:WAYPOINTMODE
	"Use Waypoint Mode to give sequential commands to the selected units--useful for prioritizing enemy targets.\n\nLeft-click icon then issue a sequence of commands."
End

DESC:WEAPONSCRAMBLESPECIALPOWER
	"Switches to using the Scramblegun weapon jammer, which stops targets from firing."
End

DESC:WEAPONSCRAMBLESPECIALPOWEROFF
	"Swaps out the Weapon Jammer for the Icarus 20 mm CIWS anti-aircraft cannon."
End

DESCRIPTION:BUTTONJAIV_TRANSFORM
	"Switches to Jet Tengu flight configuration for air superiority and superior mobility."
End

DESCRIPTION:BUTTONJAIV_TRANSFORMOFF
	"Switches to amphibious Mecha Tengu mode for anti-infantry fast-attack capability."
End

DESCRIPTION:SPECIALPOWERSHRINKRAY
	"Zaps ground units down to an embarrassing and easily crushable yet speedy little size."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEALLIEDTECH2
	"Receive encrypted signals that unlock the next tier of units at your production structures."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEALLIEDTECH3
	"The full brunt of the Allied military becomes available once these permissions are granted."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANBARRACKSTECH2
	"Expands this facility to the next level, granting access to recruit Imperial Shinobi."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANBARRACKSTECH3
	"Completes the expansion of this facility, enabling access to Japan's elite women warriors."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANCONSTRUCTIONYARDTECH2
	"Expands this facility to the next level, unlocking new technology for production."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANCONSTRUCTIONYARDTECH3
	"Completes the expansion of this facility, unlocking additional production options."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANNAVALYARDTECH2
	"Expands this facility to the next level, unlocking a wider variety of units for production."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANNAVALYARDTECH3
	"Completes the expansion of this facility, allowing the mighty Shogun Battleship to be built."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANWARFACTORYTECH2
	"Expands this facility to the next level, unlocking new vehicles for production."
End

DESCRIPTION:UPGRADEJAPANWARFACTORYTECH3
	"Completes the expansion of this facility, unlocking the latest mechanized forces."
End

Dialog:Cancel
	"Cancel"
End

Dialog:OK
	"OK"
End

DIALOGEVENT:A02SUBTITLE
	"*That vehicle there is my 'Mirage' tank - disguised as a Soviet Apocalypse tank.[3.3]You'll be in command of the Assault destroyers behind it.[6.1]Now, as long as you stay close to my Mirage tank, nobody can see you.[10.1]And as long as this Soviet disguise holds up, they won't attack me.[15.1]Got it?[16.5]Okay.[17.3]Let's get moving, shall we?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The Soviet Union is on Britain's doorstep. You must do everything possible to repel the incoming attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Expect waves of Soviet forces to approach by air drop."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Unfortunately we do not have heavy armor reinforcements at this time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*You must make due with the coastal defenses already at Brighton Beach. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*The Soviet forces are continuing their frontal assault, even though your defenses have held. You must keep fighting."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*We detect a large fleet of their Kirov airships in the vicinity. Be prepared, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*The Soviets are inbound. You must assemble an infantry division in order to stop them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Remember that you have access to an Armor Facility and therefore can build Multigunner IFVs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*You also have access to the Multigunner Turret base defenses, which should keep the enemy at bay."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*The IFV is armed with a rocket launcher, though you can modify its weapon by ordering any infantry unit inside."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*We need you to get those beach defenses back online. The Soviet forces are almost here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*The Soviets are approaching with their Mobile Construction Vehicles. While unarmed, they are heavily armored."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Soviet combat wave defeated. Additional Soviet units still incoming."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*A final Soviet assault wave has been detected on radar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*Try to build up as many defenses and garrison as many structures as you can."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*More MCV's inbound. Take them down before they reach the beach."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*MCV's are down. Dispose of any additional Soviet forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*The Soviet Dreadnought's ballistic rockets can destroy your forces- beware of their danger."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*There is a Hospital to the south. One of your Engineers can capture it to transfer its healing benefits to your infantry forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*This Hospital will now automatically heal your infantry units."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*Commander, the Soviets have destroyed your base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*Commander, the Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*Brighton Beach is under siege by Soviet forces. The city must be liberated so we can bolster our defense against additional waves."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*We are mustering defenses. Please make do with these Peacekeepers and Attack Dogs for now."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*Peacekeepers are especially effective against enemy infantry in very close quarters. Their riot shields let them close the distance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*Our Attack Dogs recently acquired amplification modules, allowing their barks to deafen and stun enemy infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL27
	"*This base will be your staging area against the incoming attack waves."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL28
	"*Your co-commander has been issued a Mobile Construction Vehicle to provide additional support."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL29
	"*The Soviet armada appears to be spread out. Their first wave is imminent."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL30
	"*A Soviet naval force has been detected off the coast. The armada will be here shortly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL31
	"*Javelin Soldiers are now authorized in the defense of this area. Train them from the Boot Camp."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL32
	"*Vehicle production authority granted. You now have access to the Multigunner Infantry Fighting Vehicle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL33
	"*Multigunner IFVs are available from the Armor Facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL34
	"*Brighton's long-dormant coastal defenses can be brought to bear against the enemy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL35
	"*To bring the guns online, train Engineers from your Boot Camp and send them inside the coastal guns."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL36
	"You are authorized to construct an Armor Facility and Multigunner Turret defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL39
	"The civilian population has been evacuated. Your infantry may garrison the deserted structures for protection."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDINTEL40
	"You have been assigned a Co-Commander for this mission. He will aid in the defense of Great Britain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDSOLDIER01
	"Allied bombers inbound, Commander. Ready to pound the ground."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_ALLIEDSOLDIER02
	"Don't worry, Commander, we've got your back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_COGILES01
	"*Looks like they're advancing towards your base. I'll send my forces south to assist you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_COGILES02
	"*Beach defenses are online. These should shake things up a little bit."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA01_COGILES03
	"*Hah, looks like we've done it! Those Soviets got too greedy for their own good this time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The Soviets are entrenched in Cannes and have set up a naval blockade in this region. We cannot attack head-on."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*However, we have detected vulnerabilities in the Soviet perimeter and are sending an infiltration team to break through their ranks. Here is what we need you to do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Infiltrate the Soviet island-harbors."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Find a way to eliminate the naval blockade."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*We also have a wing of Allied aircraft trapped here. Try to recover it if possible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*Agent Tanya will be joining you for this mission. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*The Soviet navy is in disarray. This is the opportunity to strike."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Focus your efforts on the Soviet military installation on land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*If you can take it out, we will have regained our defensive foothold in France."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*Commander, your Spies can disguise themselves as enemy troops."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*Select the Spy and target an enemy unit for attack. The Spy will assume that unit's form."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*Once disguised, your Spies can walk into enemy territory undetected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Commander, those Russian Bears operate mainly by smell- they can sniff out disguised Spies."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*If the Spies are detected, they'll lose their disguise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*Great job, Commander. We're teleporting in reinforcements to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*Great job, Commander. We're sending reinforcements to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*You have access to the same Technology as your co-commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*Commander, your Spies can also bring enemies to our side with the bribe ability."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*Without Tanya or a Barracks you'll be unable to continue. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*Commander, without Spies or a Barracks you'll be unable to continue. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of infiltrating it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of garrisoning it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*Commander, you destroyed your objective instead of liberating it. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*Leaders from several Allied nations are pinned in the Convention Center. Clear the Soviet forces from the area so they can evacuate."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL27
	"*Our Vindicator bombers cannot take off as long as those Soviet defenses are intact - take the defenses offline to recover our aircraft."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL28
	"*Our Spies may use their Bribe ability to convert those Soviet forces to work for us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL29
	"*The Allied leaders are under siege. You must liberate the conference center."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL30
	"*Our Spies must be sent into each of those Port structures. Train additional Spies if need be."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL31
	"*Those Soviet Dreadnoughts are bombarding our position. Find a way to sink them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL32
	"*The main Soviet base in Cannes is now vulnerable to direct attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL33
	"*Your co-commander has been defeated. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_ALLIEDINTEL34
	"*Do not attack the Port buildings – to do so endangers the mission objectives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_COWARREN01
	"*Observation Post captured. Now we can see what these Soviets are up to."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_COWARREN02
	"*I'll be working towards getting the Allied leadership freed, Commander. Your assistance would be welcome."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_COWARREN03
	"*Those Dreadnoughts are making it real hard to advance on the Soviet's base. Are you going to take those out, Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_TANYA03
	"Gah, Tesla Coils! Commander, I need you to send our Spies in and take down their power. That'll give me enough time to run in and blow up those defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA02_TANYA06
	"Attention Soviet fleet: Return to harbor immediately. There is evidence of onboard insurgents. All vehicles subject to search."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The Soviet headquarters is located here in Heidelberg. Your mission is to setup base and destroy the headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Here is what we need you to do:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Escort your Mobile Construction Vehicles upriver. Intel suggests the Soviets may not be expecting an amphibious assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Stage a direct assault against the Soviet headquarters near Heidelberg castle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*Coordinate attacks upon the Soviets- they have much production capability. Good luck with your mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*The Soviet headquarters is protected by a device called the Iron Curtain. Be very careful when engaging forces augmented by this device."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*Your primary objective is to take out the Soviet headquarters. Do whatever it takes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Get those MCV's safely up the ramps, Commander. I'll brief you on the rest of the mission once you're done."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*Your Hydrofoils can toggle between two weapons, a standard attack and Weapon Jammer.  Target those Tesla Coils with the Jammer and your Co-Commander's dolphins should be able to approach them unharmed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*That Iron Curtain is able to temporarily make a Soviet force invincible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*Commander, our Vindicators are primed for hit and run attacks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*Your Hydrofoils have been destroyed.  Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Your Co-Commander's dolphins have been destroyed. Mission Aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*Your base has been destroyed, Commander. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*The Soviets have destroyed your Co-Commander's base. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*The Soviets appear to have built their base with the majority of their power and resources in vulnerable positions."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*Striking at those targets should significantly reduce their effectiveness in defending against our attacks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*The enemy has sold off those outer base defenses, in order to bring his inner base defenses back online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*There are two more Super-Reactors north-east of the War Factories. Taking those down should cut power to the Soviet base again."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_COLISS01
	"*Vindicator team inbound on Soviet Iron Curtain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_COLISS02
	"*I've taken down their north base. I'm heading down to help you finish up the other one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_COLISS03
	"*Nice work. How about giving me a helping hand with this other part of their base?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_COLISS04
	"*All right, this is it. Let's move on their HQ and get this over with."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_TANYA01
	"Commander, the Soviets have set up shop down here and have me completely surrounded."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA03_TANYA02
	"There's too much heat for me to leave safely. I'm gonna need you to come down here and get me."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The Empire of the Rising Sun has overtaken Gibraltar and is using it to stage attacks against both Allied and Soviet positions. Here is your mission:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Extract our field agent making his escape from the area. He has vital information."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Locate and recover our naval forces that are on lockdown in this area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Find and eliminate the Imperial forces stationed around the Gibraltar airport."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*As you know, this is a joint Allied-Soviet initiative. The Soviet Union which has agreed to collaborate with Allied forces against the Empire."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*Agent Tanya as well as the Soviet Union's own Natasha will be on the ground to ensure our joint task force is working together as expected. Good luck in the field."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*Commanders, both the Prospector and Sputnik can be used to expand your base onto land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*An approaching Imperial Fleet has been detected on radar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*Commander, a forward recon element has called for backup in Gibraltar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*We are sending you and our new Soviet ally to assist them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*We're pulling out the big guns for this too, both of you  will be deployed with your Spek-Ops units"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*The powers that be are pulling out the big guns for this one - Allied forces will receive Tanya and our Soviet friends, Natasha."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Our spy has been debriefed. The Assault Destroyers are located in the port."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*They are heavily guarded- becareful."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*Take out those Turrets and they'll be good to go."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*You'll need to take out the turrets, then send in some engineers to get the destroyers running again."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*Warning: A King Oni battlewalker has been detected on the rock of Gibraltar."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*It may identify our assault forces unless it is eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*Cryo-technology access upgraded. You are authorized to construct Cryocopters, which can freeze or shrink enemy forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*Target the landed aircraft to clear the runways."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*Assault Destroyers online. You are authorized to construct additional Destroyers at your Seaport."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*Alert: Your co-commander requires your assitance."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_NATASHA02
	"Oh Tanya, when will you learn? From Mother Russia's bosom spring soldiers who are superior in every way. And I am the greatest of these."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_NATASHA04
	"This is not cold! I once swam Siberia's Lena River. Now that is cold!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_TANYA02
	"Why you little... Commander, permission to speak freely? I hate that chick!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA04_TANYA06
	"Whoa baby! That's chilly!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*We have organized a strike against the Empire's armada situated in the North Sea. We do not yet have accurate details about the composition of this fleet."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*This will be another joint operation with Soviet forces. Your first order of business will be the following:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Assist in the salvage operation of a downed Imperial vessel."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Our salvage ship will need to be defended whilst the information on the Empire's armada is recovered."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*Once the data is recovered, standby for further orders in the field. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*This junker contains necessary data on the Floating Island Fortress. Protect our recovery vessel until we can extra all the data from the wreck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*The salvage boat has been destroyed. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Intelligence recovered…commence analysis."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*Those two Radar Boats allow the Fortress to attack long range targets. They must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*With the Radar Boats destroyed, our MCVs can get close enough to deploy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*We're taking heavy losses. Allied Command is uploading emergency plans for the Aircraft Carrier."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*Allied Command has given access to construct the Century Bomber. With it, we can drop bombs…or infantry."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Intelligence has dispatched a new regiment of Spies. Try to take better care of these."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*There are all the Engineers our Soviet friends could spare. Use them wisely."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*Use your Engineers to capture the Fortress Reactors.  They'll overload the cores, making them unstable."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*We'll need to establish a beachhead before we can produce any ground units."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*With both Reactors simultaneously destabilized, the Fortress' power system will reach critical mass."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*One of the Reactors has been destroyed. There's no way for us to take the Fortress down now. Mission aborted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*One Reactor has been captured and destabilized. Both reactors must be captured."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*The unstable Reactor has corrected itself. You'll need to send in another Engineer."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*The Radar Boat is vulnerable. Send Natasha to destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*Commander, Spies can take down the power to the guns, allowing Natasha to get close enough to destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*Enemy Ships inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*The way to the radar ship is clear. Use Tanya to destroy it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*Enemy Aircraft are targeting the recovery ship- it must survive."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*Keep the Japanese away from the recovery ship."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL27
	"*Clear a path for the Soviet Engineers so they can hack the powerplants"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL28
	"*Let the Engineer know when it is safe to enter a power plant."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL29
	"*The Soviet Engineers can hack these powerplants to take down the defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL30
	"*The Imperial Radar Ship in the vicinity allow the Floating Fortress to attack long range targets. Destroy every Radar Ship you find."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_ALLIEDINTEL31
	"*This sunken battleship contains details on the Imperial Floating Fortress nearby. Protect our recovery vessel while we extract the data."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA01
	"I have Radar Boat in sight. Is cowering behind gun emplacement ... like child."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA02
	"Wait here while I get to work."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA03
	"I need that Generator deactivated before I can get in range."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA04
	"First Power Plant eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA05
	"Another Power Plant destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_NATASHA06
	"All Generators destroyed. Targeting Radar Boat."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_TANAY01
	"The second Radar Ship is under heavy guard. We need to be careful."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_TANAY04
	"It's working! The first guns are active."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_TANAY05
	"Let's go grab another Generator."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA05_TANAY08
	"The second Radar Ship has gone belly up. Send in the MCV's!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The President Ackerman has targeted with Soviet Union with some sort of weapon located within a firing base at the foot of Mt. Rushmore."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Allied command requires you to stop him. Your objective is this:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Destroy the Radio Tower before President Ackerman can trasmit the launch codes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Expect to face forces loyal to the American President on this mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*We do not know what else President Ackerman has in store in this region and will update you as we learn more. Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*We are not fully aware of Mt. Rushmore's firing capability. However, please be advised of the following:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*Each of the weaponized heads appears to be linked to a control center. You may be able to disable the heads at those control centers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Your primary objective is to stop the President's plan by destroying the Rushmore firing base before he gets there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*Afterwards, you will be authorized to engage the President's vehicle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*Commander, the radio tower is just ahead. You need to take it out before Ackerman can transmit the launch signal."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*The Power Plant supplying the base defenses is located to the northwest. Take it out to bring those guns offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*With the Radio Tower has been destroyed, Ackerman cannot transmit the launch code."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*The Intercontinental Laser inside of Mount Rushmore is still capable of firing, but Ackerman is going to need to get inside the Firebase to trigger it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*You have however long it takes the President to reach the Firebase to prevent the attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*Your Engineers could reactivate this abandoned base by capturing it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*Massive power surges have been detected beneath Mount Rushmore."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*Ackerman has activated a high-powered laser defense at Mt. Rushmore- within each president's head. You'll need to capture the Control Center to deactivate it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*Another presidential head capable of firing lasers has come online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*Rushmore Control Center captured. One of the lasers is powering down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*You now have access to construct Mirage Tanks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*You have been authorized to construct Spectrum Towers. They are very effective anti-vehicle defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*The President is enroute to the firing base. It must be destroyed before he arrives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*The President is getting close to the Firebase."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*Ackerman's at the Firebase. Launch of Intercontinental Laser imminent…Mission Failed"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*The Firebase has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*Ackerman has boarded a helicopter. It must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL27
	"*President Ackerman has escaped….Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL28
	"*The President has moved from his Limo to an escape helicopter. Take it down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL29
	"*The base defenses guarding the Com Tower are connected to the Power Plant to the north west."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL30
	"*Those are enemy Attack Dogs. Your Engineers and Spies should avoid them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL31
	"*Capturing a Head Control Center with an Engineer will take one of the Rushmore head lasers offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL32
	"*Power to the Base Defenses has been cut."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL33
	"*George Washington's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL34
	"*Thomas Jefferson's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL35
	"*Abraham Lincoln's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL36
	"*Roosevelt's weapon systems are now online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL37
	"*The Head Control Centers are not accessible by land. You will need to air-drop Engineers in order to reach them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_ALLIEDINTEL38
	"*Our Mirage Tank assault forces have been stationed here all along. They are now under your control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR01
	"*Just tell me where you need these Spies and Engineers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR02
	"*My Spies can temporarily disable that Power Plant."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR03
	"*Sit tight, I've got anti-vehicle troops headed your way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR04
	"*I'm going to set up at that abandoned base over there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR05
	"*The President is getting close. We need to stop him."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR06
	"*OK... how are we supposed to fight a mountain?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR07
	"*I'll try to take back the control center."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR08
	"*I just took one of those giant heads offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR09
	"*I'll try to take that Barracks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR10
	"*These Spectrum Towers are tearing me apart..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA06_COWARR11
	"*Man, to think I even voted for this nutjob..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The time has come for our joint attack against the Imperial military infrastructure in Tokyo Harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Soviet forces were waylaid en route to this location so you must engage the Empire and await Soviet reinforcements."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Your objectives here are as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Eliminate the Battleship blockade preventing Soviet forces into the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*Use our Chronosphere to transfer forces across the field to surround the Imperial defenders."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*Destroy the Empire's military capability in this region."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*Succeed, and the Empire will fall--it will no longer be a threat. Be careful in this operation, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*The situation has turned for the worse. We have word that Soviet reinforcements have turned around."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*You will need to find a way to complete this mission with the resources you already have."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*Good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*Commander, you must hurry and destroy the Imperial blockade."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*The Imperial Military Head Quarters has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*The Imperial Harbor is no more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*The Imperial Robotics Lab has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*The Imperial Super Weapon has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*Some of your forces withstood the Imperial psionic decimator. We must counterattack immediately using our own Chronosphere."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*Use the Chronosphere to split your forces by teleporting them across the battlefield."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*A pincer attack may take the Empire of the Rising Sun by surprise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*The Grand Dojos of the Empire of the Rising Sun have been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*Our Athena Cannon long-range bombardment reinforcements have arrived, and you are now authorized to produce more as needed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_COLISS01
	"*Just give the signal and I'll setup at the secondary location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_COLISS02
	"*Well done, that's one less thing to worry about."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_COLISS03
	"*Nice job, you beat me to that one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_COLISS04
	"*So the Soviets aren't coming? What do you think? Can handle this one on our own...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA07_COLISS05
	"*This must be where all those Imperial robots come from. I bet if we wipe this place out, they won't have a leg left to stand on."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*We have reasonable suspicions of Soviet activity here in Havana. Allied command is concerned, due to this region's proximity to several Allied nations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*Your mission here is as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Your expeditionary force must discover the nature and strength of the Soviet forces here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Be prepared to engage Soviet forces if necessary."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*The Soviet Union is staging bombing runs from Havana using modified sporting arenas."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*These arenas all must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*Ensure none of the Soviet Kirov Airships exits this airspace."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Our information network should have seen this sooner. Please forgive us, and good luck."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*We've disguised this Mirage Tank as a Soviet Apocalypse Tank,  in order to sneak troops past the Soviets.  Keep close to the Tank while its mirage field is active and you'll be invisible."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*Use your spies to bribe enemy soldiers, and they will join your side."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*Kill or bribe the soldiers to clear the way for the mirage tank."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*Investigate Havana for Soviet activity"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*Commander, we need to know the location of the Soviet Base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*The Soviet base has been located. It must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*You must not let any Kirov's get away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*Take out the Kirov Launch Facilities to prevent the Kirovs from launching."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*Commander, you need to keep your troops under the mirage field."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*A Kirov is almost out of Havana- you must not let it get away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*Another Kirov is about to escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*That Kirov is about to get way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*The Mirage Tank has been destroyed. Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*All of your troops have been killed. Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*A Kirov escaped our grasp. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*There is another Kirov in the sky."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*They've launched another Kirov."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*Order your forces to get closer to the Mirage Tank, to signal to your Co-Commander that you are ready to keep moving forward."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES01
	"*The Soviets must have some sort of salvage operation here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES02
	"*Don't get crushed by those tanks!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES03
	"*Heads-up, MiG fighters overhead."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES04
	"*Don't worry, I don't think they spotted us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES05
	"*Never thought I'd get saluted by the likes of them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES06
	"*Look! Real apocalypse tanks."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES07
	"*Back up! Back up!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES08
	"*Let's take them on! Disengaging gap generator and switching to combat mode."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES09
	"*Not if we start taking out these sports arenas!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES10
	"*There's only one sports arena left."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES11
	"*You see, commander? A proper military education and a steady temper always wins the day. I'll be sure to put in a jolly good word for you if you do the same. See you back at Command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES12
	"*Reinforcements have arrived.  Let's build up and roll out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES13
	"*That Kirov! It's almost left Havana!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES14
	"*I'll make sure to shoot down as many Kirovs going over the sea as I can."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES15
	"*I'll expand to that area right away."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES16
	"*Let me know if you want me to expand out."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES17
	"*Oh I think they will alright!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES18
	"*That vehicle there is my Mirage tank disguised as a Soviet Apocalypse tank. You'll be in command of the spies behind it. Now as long as you stay close to my Mirage tank, nobody can see you. And as long as this Soviet disguise holds up they won't attack me. Got it? Okay, let's get moving."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COGILES19
	"*Good grief! This is terrible! They're launching Kirov's out of the sports arenas. If we don't take them down ourselves, they'll escape and wipe out one of our cities!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR01
	"*That MCV is kind of…cute?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR02
	"*Well that was interesting!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR03
	"*Let's kick these Soviets off the plateau."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR04
	"*If we let the premier go to Space, there's no telling what he might do!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR05
	"*Maybe we should just let them go to the moon…"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR06
	"*We're running out of time."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR07
	"*I'll meet up with your forces shortly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR08
	"*I'll start taking out the eastern Iron Curtains, one by one."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR09
	"*I'm going to take down the western Iron Curtains now."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR10
	"*Let's focus our assault on the shuttle."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA08_COWARR11
	"*I'll fire the Proton Collider on that base at once."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL01
	"*The decision is made to bring the Soviet leadership to justice. We are mobilizing our forces to appear on their doorstep in Leningrad."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL02
	"*We are trying a risky tactic: shrinking our MCVs to get deep into Soviet territory to take them by surprise."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL03
	"*Expect fierce resistance. Here are your objectives:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL04
	"*Clear a drop zone for Allied forces incoming via our Chronosphere technology."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL05
	"*Eliminate the Soviet defenses in this area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL06
	"*Ensure the Soviet Premier does not escape. Bring down his fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL07
	"*The Soviet Premier is attempting to escape."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL08
	"*Your priority is to destroy the fortress launch facility before he succeeds."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL09
	"*Good luck. This is it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL10
	"*We're shrinking your MCV's so you can sneak past the Soviet Defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL11
	"*Good luck, Commanders. Above all else, avoid being crushed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL12
	"*The destroyed Soviet bases can be used as expansion locations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL13
	"*T-minus 25 minutes until the Shuttle Launch"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL14
	"*T-minus 15 minutes until the Shuttle Launch"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL15
	"*T-minus 10 minutes until Shuttle Launch."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL16
	"*5 minutes until Shuttle Launch. The situation is reaching critical mass."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL17
	"*The Soviet Shuttle has launched- Mission Failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL18
	"*All of your forces have been destroyed. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL19
	"*They took out one of our MCV's. Aborting mission."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL20
	"*If you need resources, expand to one of those destroyed bases."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL21
	"*Your MCV has unpacked outside the chrono drop zone. Chrono coordinates lost. Mission failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL22
	"*General Krukov’s military base has come online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL23
	"*General Krukov has activated the vacuum imploder. Destroy it before he uses it on your base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL24
	"*An Iron Curtain has been destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL25
	"*All Iron Curtains offline. The shuttle launch facility is now vulnerable."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL26
	"*The shuttle launch facility must be destroyed before the Premier escapes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL27
	"*The launch facility is highly resistant to direct fire. Find a way to bring it down quickly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MA09_ALLIEDINTEL28
	"*Commander - you are cleared to construct the Proton Collider. The effects of this weapon would be catastrophic to any of the densely-packed Soviet bases here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_AIRCRAFTCARRIER
	"Aircraft Carriers are powerful naval artillery platforms, which can neutralize enemy installations from a safe distance. Their combat drones automatically return to rearm between bombing runs. Carriers can also launch the Blackout Missile, which deactivates vehicles or structures caught in its blast.\n"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_APOLLOFIGHTER
	"*Apollo Fighters are air-superiority jets, armed with rapid-fire cannons that can tear enemy aircraft to bits.  Their special ability is to quickly return to their Airbase to reload and repair as necessary."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_ASSAULTDESTROYER
	"Assault Destroyers are sturdy amphibious warships armed with heavy cannons effective against armored targets. Instead of using their main guns, they can activate their Black-Hole Armor, which automatically draws incoming fire directed at nearby friendly forces.\n"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_ATHENACANNON
	"*Athena Cannons are mobile artillery units linked to our space defense network. They can pinpoint targets from long range, causing a proton beam to fire down from orbit.  Their special ability is the Aegis shield, a barrier that temporarily protects the Athena cannon and nearby units. Athena Cannons cannot act while the shield is up."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_ATTACKDOG
	"*Attack Dogs are trained for amphibious scouting and light combat. Their attack is lethal to most infantry. They can detect disguised enemy units as well.  Their special ability is a deafening bark that paralyzes enemy infantry within earshot."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_CENTURYBOMBER
	"*Century Bombers are well-armored flying infantry transports that can carpet-bomb enemy bases to dust.  They must rearm back at an Airbase between bombing runs, at which time they can pick up more infantry to paradrop behind enemy lines."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_CRYCOPTER
	"*Cryocopters are special support units which can freeze targets. Frozen units cannot act and are highly vulnerable to attack.  The Cryocopter's special ability is the Shrink Beam, which temporarily reduces a target in size, making it less powerful and easily crushed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_DOLPHIN
	"The Allied navy employs specially-trained Dolphins armed with sonic weapons for scouting the seas and intercepting enemy ships. Dolphins have the special ability to jump up and out of the water to avoid dangerous situations.\n"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_ENGINEER
	"*Though defenseless against enemy units, Engineers can capture neutral or enemy structures on land or at sea. They can also repair your damaged structures.  Their special ability is to set up a first-aid tent, which causes any of your infantry units in the vicinity to gradually recover from injuries."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_GUARDIANTANK
	"*Guardian Tanks are armed with main guns that work well against most vehicles and structures. These tanks can even crush enemy infantry.  Their special ability is to switch to a targeting laser that reduces the armor of an enemy, making it more vulnerable to attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_HYDROFOIL
	"Hydrofoils are swift vessels that can quickly cut through enemy aircraft using their rapid-firing autocannons. Their special ability is to switch to using a Weapon Jammer, which prevents targeted foes from attacking.\n"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_JAVELINSOLDIER
	"*Javelin Soldiers carry portable missile launchers effective against enemy armor and aircraft.  Their special ability is to switch to laser-guided mode, in which it takes longer to acquire a target, but grants a much faster firing rate."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_MCV
	"*Mobile Construction Vehicles are amphibious mobile HQs. Though unarmed, they are the focal point of Allied military operations.  They can unpack into Construction Yards, which build all Allied structures. Do whatever it takes to protect these facilities."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_MIRAGETANK
	"*Mirage Tanks automatically camouflage themselves as innocuous objects while immobile. They can devastate surface targets with their spectrum cannons.  Their special ability is to switch on a device that makes nearby forces invisible to the enemy. Mirage Tanks cannot camouflage or fire in this mode."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_MULTIGUNNERIFV
	"*Multigunner IFVs are quick and versatile jack-of-all-trades vehicles that automatically switch weapons depending on which infantry unit is riding inside.  Their stock weapon is an anti-air/anti-surface rocket launcher, though they can be specialized to repair vehicles, counter enemy infantry, and more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_PEACEKEEPER
	"*Peacekeepers are shotgun-wielding frontline infantry who can knock enemy infantry to the ground whilst in close quarters.  Their special ability is to switch to using a riot shield, which provides added defense whilst allowing them to close the distance with their foes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_PROSPECTOR
	"*Prospectors are amphibious resource-collecting vehicles. They are unarmed and need to be protected.  Their special ability is to unpack into Command Hubs. Other structures may then be built nearby. This conversion is irreversible yet essential for expanding to new locations."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_RIPTIDE
	"*Riptide ACVs are all-terrain assault transports, with room for several infantry as well as a mounted machine gun for protection.  Riptides are more powerful at sea, where they can attack using torpedos as well as their gun. They are useful for rushing infantry behind enemy lines."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_SPY
	"*While Spies are unarmed, they can disguise themselves as other infantry and attempt to sneak into enemy bases on land or sea. Enemy scouts can break their disguise.  They can infiltrate structures, causing the enemy base to suffer various consequences. Spies can also bribe enemy units near them to join your cause, for a fee."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_TANYA
	"*Special Agent Tanya Adams is our finest commando. She can easily dispatch enemy infantry with her pistols, and eliminate structures and vehicles with her explosives.  Tanya is a remarkable swimmer too. Her special ability is the Time Belt, which instantly transports her back in time several moments and can get her out of harm's way."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MAIN_VINDICATOR
	"*Vindicators are close-support bombers effective against enemy vehicles. They must reload at an Airbase between bombing runs.  They have a special ability that lets them quickly return to base to rearm and repair when needed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN01
	"*I shall take the hospital."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN02
	"*The Emperor wants to make a symbolic strike on the statues in the square."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN03
	"*The military barracks in the area are supplying reinforcements. We should shut them down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN04
	"*That's one statue down."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN05
	"*It appears there was quite a celebration going on here... Pitiable fools."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN06
	"*There are the boats. Let us send them to the bottom."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME01_COSHIN07
	"*More enemy patrols!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ01
	"*Don't you worry commander, those Tengus can take anything the enemy throws at them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ02
	"*I've got my eyes trained on that shoreline commander. Your Nano-Cores have nothing to fear."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ03
	"*Just give the word commander and I'll expand over to the West"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ04
	"*Expanding to these ore mines will double my effective income. Should I claim them if you don't want them?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ05
	"*Unless you say otherwise, I'll protect the Statue and you can protect the trains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ06
	"*Just give the order commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ07
	"*That's it. Our plan is proceeding as expected."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ08
	"*Hmm, well done."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ09
	"*Soviet incompetents. It's a wonder they even fight back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ10
	"*Excellent. We're almost there."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME02_COKENJ11
	"*Just a few more trains, and General Tatsu's plan will assure the Empire will dominate over Eastern Europe."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME03_COKENJ01
	"*The Shogun Executioner lives! Now we shall make these fools suffer dearly. Go on, Commander, send it on its way!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME03_COKENJ02
	"*Hah! Look at them scatter!!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME03_COKENJ03
	"*The Executioner is taking damage! Move it near one of their Tesla weapons to make it regenerate!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME04_CONAOM01
	"*The begin their pitiful attack! They will shatter against our defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME04_CONAOM02
	"*Where are our Battleships? They should have been here by now!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME04_CONAOM03
	"*Ah, the Battleships are here! Commander, let us show these mongrels  the true power of the Imperial navy."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME05_CONAOM01
	"*What... They striking at the very heart of the fortress! We need to stop them!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME05_CONAOM02
	"*These dogs would attack us on our very soil. They will come no further."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM01
	"*The coast is almost as crowded as Tokyo."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM02
	"*I'm going to clear some space for my MCV to unpack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM03
	"*I have established a foothold. Is there anything you else you need?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM04
	"*This \"fun zone\" at the beach might be fun to destroy!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM05
	"*Look, it's one of those corporate, sell-out companies! We should destroy it while we are here."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM06
	"*The authorities inside the donut shops are attacking!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME06_CONAOM07
	"*It appears our message is getting out to the civilians!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN01
	"*So much destruction from such an unsuspecting little girl!  Hahahaa!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN02
	"*Once again they have no recourse!  Charge through their defenses!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN03
	"*I could not have planned this any better!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN04
	"*From the shadows, we will strike at them until they collapse."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN05
	"*The battle is only getting started!  If only they knew what surprises were yet in store for them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME07_COSHIN06
	"*If you need any support, Commander.  Simply say the word."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME08_COKENJ01
	"*Our versatility will be paramount in this battle, Commander.  Be on your toes."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME08_COKENJ02
	"*Let the Shogun Executioner deal with these mongrels.  We can clean up after."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME08_COKENJ03
	"*It seems there are spoils of war left in the wake of destruction.  Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME08_COKENJ04
	"*Those treacherous worms!  They're shelling us from their hiding spots!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME08_COKENJ05
	"*Are you in trouble again, Commander?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN01
	"*I shall target the Air Base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN02
	"*I shall target Bingham himself!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN03
	"*The FutureTech Headquarters shall fall!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN04
	"*Relocating Construction Yard to land."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN05
	"*At last, our airforce is back online."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN06
	"*Ah yes, dry land. Deploying construction yard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN07
	"*The Proton Colliders cannot be left operational. Leave it to me!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN08
	"*None shall stand before the King Oni!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:ME09_COSHIN09
	"*So this is it, the final stand! May fate be on our side."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL01
	"*The Emperor's chosen target is the quaint Russian village of Vorkuta, which is in the midst of year-end festivities. Here are your orders:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL02
	"*Take the Soviets' coastal defenses offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL03
	"*Shatter the historic monuments in the market square."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL04
	"*Sink the Soviet naval forces at the harbor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL05
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL06
	"*The coast is too fortified for us  to land a full invasion force."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL07
	"*You will need to infiltrate with a small force and take out the coastal guns."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL08
	"*Disable the power plants to take the coastal guns offline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL09
	"*Commander, the Emperor has graciously decided to grant you a Final Squadron power for each primary objective destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL10
	"*Ah! A Final Squadron awaits your command!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL11
	"*One gun has been destroyed!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL12
	"*Another gun has been destroyed! Keep at it, Commander!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL13
	"*All coastal guns destroyed. Reinforcements are inbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL14
	"*Our Imperial Warriors can close ground on enemy infantry by using their charge ability."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL15
	"*These Armored Assassins have great proficiency when it comes to eliminating vehicles."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL16
	"*Rising Sun Engineers are making their way to the coast."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL17
	"*The Engineers have arrived. Use them to capture buildings."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL18
	"*One statue destroyed, three remaining."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL19
	"*Two monuments are left."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL20
	"*Only one statue remains."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL21
	"*The Rising Sun Navy and Naval Yards must be eliminated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL22
	"*The Yari Mini-Sub has a Kamikaze attack. Use it to take out the Soviet ships."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL23
	"*Tesla Troopers detected near one of the monuments."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL24
	"*Tesla Troopers detected near the bridge. Our Imperial shinobi should be able to strike them before they strike back."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL25
	"*A Soviet Reactor is beyond the reach of your forces. However, it is not beyond the reach of the Final Squadron protocol you've been granted."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL26
	"*More of our warriors have arrived on shore. They await your command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL27
	"*Several Imperial shinobi have appeared to aid you in your objectives. The Soviet Tesla Troopers will not be expecting them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL28
	"*Use the Sudden Transport's Evacuate ability to release your warriors from it."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL29
	"*Our Mini-Subs cannot get close enough to the Soviet navy. Eliminate the Tesla Coils so they can attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL30
	"*These Reactors are linked to the Tesla Coils defending the docks. Destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL31
	"*Our Engineers have arrived near the shoreline."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL32
	"*Do not hesitate to use the Final Squadron protocols granted you by our Emperor."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL33
	"*Either destroy the Tesla Coils or the Reactors that are powering them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL34
	"*Tesla Coils offline. The Mini-Subs may now attack undettered."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI01_IMPERIALINTEL35
	"*The Soviet Navy and Naval Yards must be eliminated."
End

