	"*Destroy the Relay Stations quickly, before time runs out!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL01
	"*Moscow is prime for the taking. Forces are already assembled for a massive assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL02
	"*The Soviets are well defended, but you will have the assistance of the Shogun's Executioner. Your objectives here are simple:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL03
	"*Await the arrival of the Shogun's Executioner so that it may assist your assault."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL04
	"*The Kremlin must be destroyed. Leave nothing standing."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL05
	"*Such is the Emperor's decree."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL06
	"*The Shogun's Executioner is on a rampage through Soviet territory.  It will rendezvous with your forces shortly.  Maintain position until it arrives."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL07
	"*The Shogun's Executioner has arrived.  Support it with your forces and it shall carve a path directly to the Kremlin."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL08
	"*The Soviet artillery is of great concern. It must be dealt with."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL09
	"*More Soviet artillery.  We must deal with it quickly."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL10
	"*The Shogun's Executioner has been damaged.  Protect it until it can reach a strong enough power source to replenish itself."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL11
	"*The Shogun's Executioner is under attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL12
	"*Soviert General Krukov has dispatch forces to attack us."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL13
	"*Soviet General Krukov has ordered naval forces down river."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL14
	"*Our forces have been defeated before the Shogun's Execution arrived. The mission is lost."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL15
	"*All of our forces have been defeated. The mission is failed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL16
	"*The Soviets will move against our position very soon."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL17
	"*Hold the line, Commander.  The Shogun Executioner has nearly arrived."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL18
	"*Expand your forces northward. You must press the attack."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL19
	"*Additional Soviet forces incoming. Be on guard."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL20
	"*More Soviet forces detected on scan. They act with desperation. Proceed with care."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL21
	"*Prepare yourself Commander.  Soviet forces detected en route to your location."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL22
	"*The Kremlin lies in ruins. Status of the time machine, uncertain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL23
	"*Alert: Sources indicate that the time machine is located in a sub level facility under the Kremlin."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL24
	"*Alert: The time machine is being carried away! Destroy that helicopter!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI08_IMPERIALINTEL25
	"*Excellent work, Commander. The Emperor sends his deepest gratitude."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL01
	"*The Allies have rallied their reminant forces in Amsterdam, led by two commanders."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL02
	"*They defend the FutureTech Headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL03
	"*Defeat the Allied Air base"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL04
	"*Eliminate any Allied resistance as well."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL05
	"*This airspace is firmly in Allied control."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL06
	"*You will need to get by without our flight-capable forces initially. Only once the airspace is secure will our ministers be grant you fully authorized access."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL07
	"*Do this and the Emperor will be pleased."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL08
	"*The Soviet Union's top scientist has unleashed catastrophe upon Amsterdam in an attempt to eliminate our forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL09
	"*Our Nanoswarms protected our finest warriors."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL10
	"*Finish what we started, Commander."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL11
	"*That is the Emperor's will."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL12
	"*The FutureTech Headquarters must be destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL13
	"*Eliminate the Allied Air Base, or your armies shall remain earthbound."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL14
	"*With the Sir Case crushed, our air forces are once again yours to command."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL15
	"*General Bingham's base must be razed to the ground."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL16
	"*There are strange readings from our scanners…"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL17
	"*Soviet forces approach from the north."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL18
	"*The Soviets are using their Iron Curtain technology on the FutureTech Headquarters."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL19
	"*Destroy his Iron Curtain."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL20
	"*These King Oni shall lead us to final victory."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL21
	"*The Allies dominate the skies here. You must eliminate their Air Base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL22
	"*The Futuretech Headquarters must not stand."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL23
	"*Alert: Multiple Vacuum Imploder detonations detected. Initiating emergency Nanoswarm defenses."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL24
	"*The Allies' Proton Colliders threaten our plans. Destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL25
	"*Allied air presence weakening. All production facilities upgraded -- you may build flight-capable forces once more."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL26
	"*The Soviets' top scientist is meddling with forbidden technology. Destroy his forces."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MI09_IMPERIALINTEL27
	"*You cannot complete your tasks while our air support is denied. Destroy this Air Base."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_BURSTDRONE
	"*Burst Drones are flying robotic scouts used to survey enemy troop movements.  They may attach themselves to enemy vehicles, slowing the enemy down. Burst Drones may also self-destruct, damaging nearby targets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_ENGINEER
	"*Engineers can instantly capture neutral or enemy structures, either on land or at sea. They may also repair damaged structures.  Their special ability is to sprint. After this brief burst of energy, they run out of breath and have to take a moment to recover."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_KINGONI
	"*The King Oni are the Empire's heaviest ground forces. These battlewalkers can incinerate foes with their eyeblasters.  Their special ability is the bull rush, which they use to close the distance with enemies, or more often, to smash right into them and destroy them."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_MCV
	"*Mobile Construction Vehicles are amphibious self-powered bases that were reverse-engineered from Allied and Soviet counterparts.  They unpack into Construction Yards, which produce the nanocores that in turn convert to other Imperial structures."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_MECHATENGU
	"*The Mecha Tengu are versatile fast-attack skirmishers whose twin autocannons are particularly deadly against infantry.  There is no terrain they cannot cross. Their special ability is to transform into the Jet Tengu, a flying form effective against aircraft."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_MECHKING
	"*The Shogun Executioner is a one-of-a-kind weapon. This colossal battle robot was created to instill panic and awe in the enemy while taking on entire armies.  It may engage multiple forces at once with its various weapons systems, and can crush almost anything under its massive feet. It does require anti-aircraft support, however."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_NAGINATACRUISER
	"*Naginata Cruisers are specially made to destroy enemy ships in a hail of torpedoes.  Their special ability launches a spread of auxilliary torpedoes from hidden launch bays. This attack takes considerable time to rearm."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_NANOCORE
	"*Nanocores are portable structures. They can traverse land or sea, then unfurl into a full-sized structure where needed.  Because Cores can go almost anywhere, this provides Imperial bases with great flexibility. Note that Cores cannot pack up once unfurled."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_ORECOLLECTOR
	"*Ore Collectors are amphibious resource-gathering vehicles that travel between Ore Mines and Ore Refineries. They must be protected at all times.  They can bring up a rapid-fire weapon to defend themselves as needed, although they cannot gather ore while this security system is activated."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_ROCKETANGEL
	"*Rocket Angels are flying women warriors armed with photon rocket arrays, which are effective against armored targets both on the ground and in the air.  They may switch to using an energized Paralysis Whip, which stops a single target from moving or attacking."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_SEAWING
	"*Sea-Wings combine the functions of an anti-aircraft submarine with a close-air-support aircraft.  They must surface to attack in Sea-Wing form, whereas in Sky-Wing form, these units may attack relentlessly against ground or sea targets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_SHINOBI
	"*Shinobi are expert infiltrator-assassins. Their bladed weapons are lethal to infantry and they can traverse land and sea with equal ease.  Their special ability is a smoke bomb, which causes enemies to lose the Shinobi as a target. If a Shinobi gets inside an enemy structure, he will disrupt the enemy in various ways depending on the structure."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_SHOGUNBATTLESHIP
	"*Shogun Battleships are the finest vessels in the Imperial fleet. Nothing can stand up to a barrage from their six main guns.  Their special ability provides a temporary burst of speed, allowing these ships to crash straight through other vessels."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_STRIKERVX
	"*Striker-VXes are dual-form pilot-assisted robots designed to destroy enemy aircraft with their guided rockets. But that is not all.  Their special ability is to transform into the flying Chopper-VX form, which is effective against armored targets on the ground. Nothing is safe from these units."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_SUDDENTRANSPORT
	"*Sudden Transports may disguise themselves as other vehicles to sneak Imperial infantry behind enemy lines.  Because they hover, they can cross land or sea equally as well. Though unarmed with conventional weapons, Sudden Transports are rigged to explode if destroyed."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_TANKBUSTER
	"*Tankbusters are specially trained and outfitted to take on enemy armor. Their personal plasma-cutter cannons can punch through a battle tank quickly.  Their special ability is to dive into a spider-hole, which boosts their defense and prevents them from being crushed by vehicles. They can pop up to resume firing."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_TSUNAMITANK
	"*Tsunami Tanks are amphibious, fast-firing armored units that can quickly bring ruin to enemy bases and their military vehicles.  Their special ability briefly provides a boost to their defensive strength, though they cannot fire in this state. They can still crush infantry under their treads, however."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_WARRIOR
	"*Imperial Warriors fight using burst-firing rifles specially made to take down other infantry.  Their special ability gives them a window of opportunity to rush enemy infantry with beam katanas at the ready. One stroke from these blades is lethal."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_WAVEFORCE
	"*Wave-Force Artillery are mobile bombardment vehicles that fire energy salvoes rather than basic ballistic warheads.  Their attack is extremely powerful though the firing sequence is slow. However, their special ability lets them fire immediately--at the expense of some attack strength."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_YARIMINISUB
	"*Yari Mini-Subs are undersea scouts armed with tiny torpedoes effective against enemy naval forces.  These units must surface to fire but are invulnerable to most attacks while undersea. Their special ability causes them to self-destruct into their targets."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MIIN_YURIKO
	"*Yuriko Omega is our most powerful infantry unit. She has been trained to use her mind as a weapon, and her mind can destroy almost anything.  She may pursue her enemies either on land or at sea. Should she be outnumbered, she can send her foes flying using her Psychokinetic Burst special ability."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MN13_NODEVA05SUBTITLE
	"*GDI snipers have taken positions and threaten high casualty rates.[5.0]Find and eliminate all GDI snipers."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG01
	"*My men are taking position outside the fortress."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG02
	"*Mine are the men in green uniforms. They only take orders from me, but hey, you can always boss me around if you want."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG03
	"*Mine are the men in green uniforms. They only take orders from me, but if you need my support, let me know."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG04
	"*Attacks incoming from the south! My forces are on it!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG05
	"*That couldn't have been the last of them... What are those sneaky goats planning...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG06
	"*Is that all they had? What, have we beat them already...?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG07
	"*I don't know, those last attacks felt pretty real to me..."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG08
	"*Does he have to keep announcing his useless strategies?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG09
	"*Good job! Only a few more battleships left!"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG10
	"*I hope they're more of a challenge than you."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG11
	"*Lots of aircraft overhead... Are they crashing on purpose?"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_COOLEG12
	"*It's too quiet.  Where did everyone go?"
End

