End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_SOVIETINTEL04
	"*Defend the Fortress at all costs."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_SOVIETINTEL05
	"*Destroy the Imperial navy in the canals"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS01_SOVIETINTEL06
	"*Good luck to you."
