	"*Your objectives are as follows:"
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS05_SOVIETINTEL03
	"*Take over the Allies' ore-mining operations near the deployment zone."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS05_SOVIETINTEL04
	"*Eliminate the Allies' naval forces in the area."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS05_SOVIETINTEL05
	"*Locate and capture the Allies' science facility."
End

DIALOGEVENT:MS05_SOVIETINTEL06
	"*Good hunting."
End

