MOVIE:A01MM01_DESC
	"General Krukov introduces himself to the Commander."
End

MOVIE:A01MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 1: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:A03MM01_DESC
	"The Commander has liberated Western Europe from the Soviets."
End

MOVIE:A03MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 3: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:A06MM01_DESC
	"President Ackerman reveals his rogue plan."
End

MOVIE:A06MM01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 6: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:AFS01_DESC
	"Introducing Field Marshall Bingham. The Commander is called upon to repel the imminent Soviet invasion of Great Britain."
End

MOVIE:AFS01_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 1: Great Britain"
End

MOVIE:AFS02_DESC
	"The Commander is introduced to the American Commando, Tanya, who will help in the liberation of Cannes."
End

MOVIE:AFS02_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 2: Cannes"
End

MOVIE:AFS03_DESC
	"Agent Tanya learns of the Soviet HQ in Germany. Now it's up to the Commander to take it out."
End

MOVIE:AFS03_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 3: Heidelberg"
End

MOVIE:AFS04_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun shocks the world with a naval blockade of Europe. The Allies must now team up with the Soviets, which President Ackerman protests."
End

MOVIE:AFS04_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 4: Gibraltar"
End

MOVIE:AFS05_DESC
	"The Empire's floating island fortress in the North Sea must now be taken down."
End

MOVIE:AFS05_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 5: North Sea"
End

MOVIE:AFS06_DESC
	"President Ackerman takes matters into his own hands and threatens the alliance with the Soviets. He must be stopped."
End

MOVIE:AFS06_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 6: Mt. Rushmore"
End

MOVIE:AFS07_DESC
	"The Empire's Shogunate are assembling in Tokyo. Now is the time to strike."
End

MOVIE:AFS07_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 7: Tokyo Harbor"
End

MOVIE:AFS08_DESC
	"The Soviet Dr. Zelinsky defects and exposes the Soviet's secret base in Cuba."
End

MOVIE:AFS08_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 8: Havana"
End

MOVIE:AFS09_DESC
	"At last, it is time to overthrow the Soviet leaders holed up in Leningrad."
End

MOVIE:AFS09_NAME
	"Allies Chapter 9: Leningrad"
End

MOVIE:AFS10_DESC
	"Thanks to the Commander's efforts, the Soviet leaders are brought to justice."
End

MOVIE:AFS10_NAME
	"Allies Campaign Epilogue"
End

MOVIE:J03MM01_DESC
	"The Shogun Executioner is born."
End

MOVIE:J03MM01_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 3: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:JFS01_DESC
	"The day of destiny has arrived. Emperor Yoshiro launches an unprecedented full-scale invasion into the Soviet Union."
End

MOVIE:JFS01_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 1: Vorkuta"
End

MOVIE:JFS02_DESC
	"The Commander must continue the invasion of the Soviet Union, now with the help of the Tatsu's mechanized army."
End

MOVIE:JFS02_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 2: Stalingrad"
End

MOVIE:JFS03_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu is preparing to unleash a secret weapon upon the Soviet Union."
End

MOVIE:JFS03_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 3: Odessa"
End

MOVIE:JFS04_DESC
	"The Emperor presents the Allied nations with an ultimatum: surrender or be destroyed. However, Tatsu learns of a surprise attack upon Pearl Harbor."
End

MOVIE:JFS04_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 4: Pearl Harbor"
End

MOVIE:JFS05_DESC
	"The Allies have a second attack force making their way to the Japan mainland. They must be stopped."
End

MOVIE:JFS05_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 5: Pacific Ocean"
End

MOVIE:JFS06_DESC
	"The Emperor wants to take control of Los Angeles, the media hub of the West."
End

MOVIE:JFS06_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 6: Santa Monica"
End

MOVIE:JFS07_DESC
	"The Emperor and Tatsu discover an unexpected truth concerning their destiny."
End

MOVIE:JFS07_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 7: Yokohama Harbor"
End

MOVIE:JFS08_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu sends the Commander to Moscow to destroy the device that endangers the Empire."
End

MOVIE:JFS08_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 8: Moscow"
End

MOVIE:JFS09_DESC
	"Prince Tatsu and the Emperor find common ground amid the defeat of the Soviet Union. Now it's time for the final attack against their enemies."
End

MOVIE:JFS09_NAME
	"Rising Sun Chapter 9: Amsterdam"
End

MOVIE:JFS10_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun is victorious. The Commander is given a special honor."
End

MOVIE:JFS10_NAME
	"Rising Sun Campaign Epilogue"
End

MOVIE:S08MM01_DESC
	"Premier Cherdenko reveals his alternative plans for the Commander."
End

MOVIE:S08MM01_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 8: Intermission"
End

MOVIE:SFS00A_DESC
	"The leaders of the Soviet Union resort to a desperate plan to save themselves from imminent doom."
End

MOVIE:SFS00A_NAME
	"Red Alert 3 Prologue"
End

MOVIE:SFS00B_DESC
	"The Empire of the Rising Sun begins its overwhelming and unexpected assault on the Soviet Union."
End

MOVIE:SFS00B_NAME
	"Red Alert 3 Prologue: The Invasion"
End

MOVIE:SFS01_DESC
	"Premier Cherdenko recruits the new Commander and assigns him to defend Leningrad against the invading Empire of the Rising Sun."
End

MOVIE:SFS01_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 1: Leningrad"
End

MOVIE:SFS02_DESC
	"General Krukov tasks the Commander with intercepting Imperial forces heading towards Moscow. The old satellite launch facility, Krasna-45, must be seized."
End

MOVIE:SFS02_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 2: Krasna-45"
End

MOVIE:SFS03_DESC
	"The Soviet naval port at Vladivostok must be liberated from the Empire."
End

MOVIE:SFS03_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 3: Vladivostok"
End

MOVIE:SFS04_DESC
	"The new American President re-energizes the Allies. General Krukov and the Commander are sent to rid the Allies from their Geneva HQ before they get reinforcements."
End

MOVIE:SFS04_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 4: Geneva"
End

MOVIE:SFS05_DESC
	"The Commander must stop the Allies from exploiting their newly-discovered technology. However, the Premier is attacked by unknown forces."
End

MOVIE:SFS05_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 5: Mykonos"
End

MOVIE:SFS06_DESC
	"The Premier, having survived an attempt on his life, orders the Commander to assault the Allies' strategic airbase in Iceland. This is their last foothold in Europe."
End

MOVIE:SFS06_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 6: Iceland"
End

MOVIE:SFS07_DESC
	"The Premier assigns the newly-promoted Commander with a bold mission to eliminate the Emperor of Japan at his palace in the heart of the country."
End

MOVIE:SFS07_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 7: Mt. Fuji"
End

MOVIE:SFS08_DESC
	"The Premier sets up a trap for the Allies in the form of a false peace treaty."
End

MOVIE:SFS08_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 8: Easter Island"
End

MOVIE:SFS09_DESC
	"The Premier's seat of power has been vacated, leaving but one task remaining: The final defeat of the Americans, led by their President Ackerman."
End

MOVIE:SFS09_NAME
	"Soviets Chapter 9: New York City"
End

MOVIE:SFS10_DESC
	"The Commander has finally triumphed over the Soviet Union's mortal enemies and earned the distinguished title of Premier."
End

MOVIE:SFS10_NAME
	"Soviets Campaign Epilogue"
End

MSG:TEST2
	"And everywhere that Mary when, the lamb was sure to go."
End

MSG:TESTING
	"Mary had a little lamb, its fleece as white as snow."
End

MsiRMFilesInUse_Title
	"[ProductName] Setup"
End

MsiRMFilesInUseDescription
	"Some files that need to be updated are currently in use."
End

MsiRMFilesInUseDontUseRM
	"&Do not close applications. A reboot will be required."
End

MsiRMFilesInUseText
	"The following applications are using files that need to be updated by this setup. You can let Setup Wizard close them and attempt to restart them or reboot the machine later."
End

MsiRMFilesInUseTitle
	"{\\WixUI_Font_Title}Files in Use"
End

MsiRMFilesInUseUseRM
	"&Close the applications and attempt to restart them."
End

