	"Thank you for timely rescue! Now we shall capture those Barracks!"
End

SCRIPT:S03_USETAKEPOSAIBEACON
	"Use the Take Position directive to make your Co-Commander's forces assist with your attacks."
End

SCRIPT:S05_HINT_BUILD_MINERS
	"Use the Ore Refineries to build one additional Ore Collector vehicle per Ore Mine."
End

SCRIPT:S05_HINT_DREADNOUGHT_INTRO
	"With the Tech Inhibitor destroyed, Dreadnought-class heavy bombardment ships are now available."
End

SCRIPT:S05_HINT_MIG_INTRO
	"MiG Fighter production authority granted for use against the Allied airforce. MiG Fighters are our finest anti-air jets."
End

SCRIPT:S05_HINT_TECH_SCRAMBLER_DESTROYED
	"Tech Inhibitor destroyed. Additional authorized production options now available."
End

SCRIPT:S05_HINT_TWINBLADE_INTRO
	"Access granted to Twinblades. These combat helicopters have a powerful anti-surface attack and can transport infantry or vehicles."
End

SCRIPT:S05_TIMER_DATA_SCRAMBLED
	"Data Scrambled In:"
End

SCRIPT:S05_TIMER_HOLD_LAB
	"Data Transfered In:"
End

SCRIPT:S07_AUTOSAVE_OBJ2
	"Soviet Mission Autosave"
End

SCRIPT:S07_AUTOSAVE_OBJ3
	"Soviet Mission Autosave"
End

SCRIPT:S07_INFOBOX_01_APOCTANK
	"The Apocalypse is world's most powerful tank. Use its M-Harpoon ability to drag enemies toward it."
End

SCRIPT:S08_EMISSARY_ARRIVAL
	"Allied Emissary Arrives In:"
End

SCRIPT:S08_TIMER_VACUUM_BOMB
	"Vacuum Imploder Fires In:"
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_01_DESC
	"Capture the New York Stock Exchange"
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_01_TITLE
	"Capture the New York Stock Exchange"
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_02_DESC
	"The Allies' notorious commando has been a nuisance for far too long. Let this be her last stand."
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_02_TITLE
	"Eliminate Agent Tanya"
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_03_DESC
	"Get Terror Drones into Fort Bradley's prospectors to cut their supply lines."
End

SCRIPT:S09_BONUSOBJECTIVE_03_TITLE
	"Eliminate Ft. Bradley's Prospectors"
End

SCRIPT:S09_CHECKPOINT_01
	"S09 - Invasion"
End

SCRIPT:S09_CHECKPOINT_02
	"S09 - Statue of Liberty"
End

SCRIPT:S09_FAILTEXT_ENGINEERS
	"ABORT MISSION: There are not enough engineers to repair the captured MCVs."
End

SCRIPT:S09_FAILTEXT_UNITS
	"ABORT MISSION: All units and structures lost."
End

SCRIPT:S09_HINT_EXPANDTOFTB
	"Expand to the ore mines near Ft. Bradley."
End

SCRIPT:S09_INFOBOX_WARFACTORY
	"Stay away from the Armor Facility. Its repair drones will destroy Terror Drones in any vehicles."
End

SCRIPT:S09_OBJECTIVE_01_TITLE
	"Occupy Allied Forces until the Kirovs Arrive"
End

SCRIPT:S09_OBJECTIVE_02_DESC
	"Fort Bradley is one of the Allies' last lines of defense. Crush it utterly before moving on to your final objective in New York City."
End

SCRIPT:S09_OBJECTIVE_02_TITLE
	"Destroy Ft. Bradley"
End

SCRIPT:S09_OBJECTIVE_03_DESC
	"'This monument to Allied arrogance must be brought down by any means necessary to put the Union's old enemies in their rightful place."
End

SCRIPT:S09_OBJECTIVE_03_TITLE
	"Destroy the Statue of Liberty"
End

SCRIPT:T02_CONSTRUCT_PP
	"To construct a Power Plant, open your Production Structures Tab and click on the Power Plant button. Then when it's ready, click on the button again, then click on open terrain to place the Power Plant."
End

SCRIPT:T02_CONSTRUCT_REFINERY
	"To build an Ore Refinery, open your Production Structures Tab and click on the Ore Refinery button. Once it's ready, click on its button again and click on the open terrain just in front of the Ore Mine to place it in an optimal position."
End

SCRIPT:T02_INFO_MISSIONEND
	"Select the Guardian Tank to conclude this lesson."
End

SCRIPT:T02_INFO_MOVEALONG
	"Select the Tsunami Tank when you're ready to move on to the next area."
End

SCRIPT:T02_TRAIN_INFANTRY
	"To train Peacekeepers, click on the Infantry Tab, then click their portrait."
End

SCRIPT:T02_UNPACKMCV
	"To unpack your MCV, select it and use its Unpack ability by left-clicking on its ability button, then left-clicking on open terrain."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT1
	"To select the Cryocopter, left-click on the unit."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT10
	"To garrison a Peacekeeper in the IFV, select him and right-click on the IFV."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT11
	"To garrison the remaining Peacekeepers in the Riptide, select the Peacekeepers and right-click on the Riptide."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT12
	"To move the Riptide across the lake, right-click on the desired location."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT13
	"To evacuate the Peacekeepers, select the Riptide and left-click on the special ability button in the bottom right of the screen, or hit the \"F\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT14
	"To select Tanya, left-click on her."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT15
	"To dispose of the Conscripts, select Tanya and right-click on the enemy units."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT16
	"To disguise the Spy, select him and right-click on a Conscript."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT2
	"To use the S.H.R.I.N.K beam, select the unit and left-click on the special ability button in the bottom right of the screen (or hit the \"F\" key), then left-click on a target."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT3
	"To switch the Hydrofoil to Weapon Jammer mode, select the unit and left-click on the special ability button in the bottom right of the screen or hit the \"F\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT4
	"To stop the Apocolypse Tank, switch the Hydrofoil to Weapon Jammer mode and right-click on the tank."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT5
	"To transform the Mecha Tengu, select the unit and left-click on the special ability button in the bottom right of the screen, or hit the \"F\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT6
	"To attack the Cryocopter, select the Mecha Tengu and right-click on the enemy unit. Make sure to transform the Tengu into its air form."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT7
	"To capture the Oil Derrick, select the Engineer and right-click on the Derrick."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT8
	"To garrison the Peacekeepers, select the units and right-click on the nearby civilian structure."
End

SCRIPT:T03_TEXT9
	"To evacuate the Peacekeepers, select the occupied structure and left-click on the button in the bottom right of the screen, or hit the \"F\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT1
	"To sell a Power Plant, left-click on the Sell button under the radar, then left-click on the Power Plant."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT2
	"To repair the Construction Yard, left-click on the Repair button under the radar, then left-click on the Construction Yard."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT3
	"To access the Top-Secret Protocols menu, left-click on the yellow button in the bottom-left of the screen, or press the Tilde key."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT4
	"To acquire Surveillance Sweep, open the Top-Secret Protocols menu and left-click on the appropriate icon."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT5
	"To use Surveillance Sweep, left-click on the button on the left-hand side of the screen."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT6
	"To activate the Surveillance Sweep, left-click on a location to indicate where the sweep should start, then left-click on a second location to plot the trajectory."
End

SCRIPT:T04_TEXT7
	"Create units from the Boot Camp, Armor Facility, Seaport, or Airbase by selecting the structures and left-clicking on the unit icon on the right side of the screen."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT1
	"To infiltrate the Instant Generator, select the Spy and right-click on the structure."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT10
	"To open the Advanced Commands panel, click on the button near the unit portrait in the bottom-right of the screen."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT11
	"To set a unit to Hold Ground stance, click on the Hold Ground button in the Advanced Commands panel."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT12
	"To adequately defend the base, set three Guardian Tanks to Hold Ground stance and move them to the locations designated on the radar."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT13
	"To build a Multigunner Turret, select the Support Structures button on the sidebar and click on the appropriate structure icon."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT14
	"To construct a wall, build and place a Fortress Wall piece from the Support Structures queue, then build and place a second wall when green build grid indicators show a connection between the two wall segments."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT15
	"To select all units on the battlefield, press the \"Q\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT16
	"To cycle between unit types, press the Tab key when multiple unit types are selected."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT17
	"To use Waypoint Mode, select units and hold the Alt key while issuing move and attack orders."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT18
	"To see suppression in action, use the Javelin Soldiers to attack the garrisoned structure."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT2
	"To use the Reverse-Move command, select units that can move in reverse and press the \"D\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT3
	"To order units to Reverse Move, select a unit, press the \"D\" key, then right-click on a location."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT4
	"To instantly move the camera to the most recent radar event, press the space bar."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT5
	"To instantly move the camera back to base, press the \"H\" key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT6
	"To assign units to a Control Group, select the units, hold the control key, and press a number key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT7
	"To access an assigned Control Group, press the corresponding number key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT8
	"To instantly snap the camera to a control group, double-tap the corresponding number key."
End

SCRIPT:T05_TEXT9
	"To issue a Crush Move command, press the \"G\" key and right-click on a destination."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_ATTACKMOVE
	"To issue an Attack-Move command, select your units and press the A key. Then right-click on open terrain near your enemy's units."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_ATTACKUNITS
	"To attack an enemy unit, select your units and right-click on an enemy."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_MOVECAMERA
	"To move your camera, hold down the right mouse button and move your mouse around."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_MOVEUNITS
	"To move your units, select them and right-click on open terrain."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_ROTATECAMERA
	"To rotate your camera, hold down the middle mouse button and move your mouse around."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_SELECTUNITS
	"To select your units, left-click on them. You may also hold down the left mouse button on open terrain and drag your mouse to create a selection box around your units."
End

SCRIPT:TUTORIAL_ZOOMCAMERA
	"To zoom your camera, move your mouse wheel back and forth."
End

