	"*[1.6:5.3]Your naval forces will continue on to their destination, but your job is here, on dry land.[6.9:3.3]Build up a base, and then turn your attention to the Soviet headquarters.[10.6:2.6]Be on the lookout, sir. They know you’re here."
End

