SUBTITLE:A06TH07
	"[2.9:4.3]It looks like the President has gone rogue on us.  This is just so hard to believe.[8:2.5]Nevertheless, we have a job to do, commander.[10.7:4.2]Take out the communications tower before he transmits an order to fire!"
End

SUBTITLE:A06TH08
	"[2.1:3.1]The weapons from the monument are being powered by three locations.[5.5:3]Each one that you capture will disable one of three heads.[8.8:3.9]You’d better hurry. The President is getting close to firing the weapon!"
End

SUBTITLE:A06TH09
	"*[0.6:1.5]Good to see you again, sir.[2.1:5.7]Not sure what to make of this situation, but I'm here to follow orders, and my orders are to support you.[7.8:1.7]I’m ready when you are!"
End

