	"*[0.8:1.4]This is unbelievable![2.2:3.3]I knew he was always a little wound up, but I didn't see this coming.[5.4:3.8]Well, let’s get moving.  We've got to stop our crazy president."
End

SUBTITLE:A07MM01
	"*[4.2:1.3]Bad news, Commander.[6.4:1.8]The Soviets aren’t coming.[8.1:4.3]We don’t have any more information on this, but it looks like they’ve hung us out to dry.[12.4:2.8]We're going to need you to do this without their help.[15.6:4.3]We’ll never have a better shot at taking out the Empire than we have right here."
End

