End

SUBTITLE:A08TH04
	"*[1.3:2.5]You’re going to have to look around and see what you can find.[3.9:2.3]Employ your spies to avoid detection."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH05_01
	"*[0.7:2]Ah, marvelous to see you again, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH05_02
	"*[2.8:2.6]Look, we have to be careful not to alert the enemy."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH05_03
	"*[5.4:4.5]If you stay under the shield projected by my Mirage Tank, you’ll be invisible to them."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH05_04
	"*[10.3:2.5]Unless, of course, you decide to attack…"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH06_01
	"*[0.7:1.7]Good grief!"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH06_02
	"*[3:1.9]Is that a Kirov…"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH06_03
	"*[5.5:2.5]coming out of a baseball stadium?"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH07_01
	"*[1.1:2.8]I must say, sir, working with you is anything but dull."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH07_02
	"*[4:2.5]I’m gonna try and keep those Kirovs from escaping."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH07_03
	"*[6.5:3.5]Maybe you could focus on taking out those annoying Stadiums?"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH08_01
	"*[0.4:4.5]If I can grab those resources over there, I can build up enough to launch some air attacks."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH08_02
	"*[5:2.4]Let me know when you think the time is right."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH09_01
	"*[0.4:3.8]I knew my top scores at the academy would get us through this."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH09_02
	"*[5.3:1.2]Hold on a second…"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH09_03
	"*[7.4:2]is that… a Kirov?"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH09_04
	"*[10.8:2.3]It's coming out of a baseball stadium?"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH10_01
	"*[0.5:3.7]It’s been a pleasure and an honor, sir. This has been quite some ride."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH10_02
	"*[4.3:2.8]In fact, I think I might just write a book about it."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH10_03
	"*[7.7:3]Maybe some day we can share a single malt together, eh?"
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH10_04
	"*[11.3:1.1]Cheers, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH11
	"[2.3:2.9]That’s right! A Baseball Stadium.[5.2:7.9]Each Kirov is equipped with a 50 megaton bomb and is heading towards an Allied city of our choosing.[13.4:1.7]Dasvedanya."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH12
	"[1.3:2.6]So you destroyed one sports arena.[3.9:3.6]Don't worry, we have plenty of Kirovs to go around."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH13
	"[1.4:2.9]You are like an annoying housefly.[7.7:2.2]It's time to swat the fly."
End

SUBTITLE:A08TH14
	"[1.3:2.5]I only need one sports arena.[4.2:2.8]HEY! Get more Kirovs in the air, now!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH01_01
	"*[0.3:3.5]Congratulations, Commander! You've done it!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH01_02
	"*[4.2:5.4]Those Soviets deserved every bit of what you've just given them. Magnificent work!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH02_01
	"*[0.3:3.8]We're running out of time, Commander, don't let the Premier get away!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH03_01
	"*[0.4:2.5]I've got something up my sleeve for you, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH03_02
	"*[3.5:3]Why don't you come a little bit closer to my base?"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH04_01
	"*[0.3:4.7]Commander, you've rained on my glorious parade!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH04_02
	"*[5.3:3.4]For this, I'm sending everything I've got at you."
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH04_03
	"*[9:4.2]But I won't let you have the satisfaction of catching me!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH04_04
	"*[13.2:5.9]I'm escaping to the one place that hasn't been corrupted by capitalism …"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH04_05
	"*[21.6:1.9]space!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH05_01
	"*[0.3:4]Are you not going to make it to my send-off, Commander?"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH06_01
	"*[0.6:2.6]Dasvidanya, Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH06_02
	"*[3.3:3.9]I'll send you a postcard from my space station."
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH07_01
	"*[0.4:4.8]Aww, you made it all this way just to fail at the end!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH07_02
	"*[6.3:1.7]Such a shame."
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH08
	"*[1.3:3.9] We’re shrinking down some MCVs to run through the strong Soviet resistance.  [5.8:5.7]Set up a base deep inside their territory so we can use the Chronosphere to move in some forces!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH09
	"*[1.5:5.5]The Premier is trying to escape! He has barricaded himself into the fortress at the center of these Canals.[6.8:6.2]You can’t let him get away. Take these credits, assemble an army, and stop the shuttle before it launches!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH10
	"*[1:1.3]Well this is it.[2.6:2]And I'm right here with you commander.[4.5:5.2]You can count on me to do whatever it takes to put these backstabbers down today!"
End

SUBTITLE:A09TH11
	"*[1.5:1.9]It has been a privilege and an honor, sir.[4.2:3.7]You're the finest Commander I’ve known… and a true hero to the Allies."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_01
	"*[2.7:4.5]Premier Cherdenko continues to push his Soviet forces into Western Europe"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_02
	"*[7:4.9]seizing control of key regions left behind by the retreating Allies."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_03
	"*[12.4:4.3]Great Britain now stands as the last European nation"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_04
	"*[16.6:2.7]yet to feel the jackboot of Soviet aggression."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_05
	"*[19.4:1.7]That might be short-lived however,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_06
	"*[21.1:3.4]as sources tell us that a vast Soviet armada"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_07
	"*[24.6:3.8]has been spotted off the Northern coast of France."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_08
	"*[36.8:0.9]Commander,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_09
	"*[38.3:3.7]I'm Field Marshal Robert Bingham, Chief of the Allied Military Command."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_10
	"*[42.9:2.3]I've been told that you're a very capable officer."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_11
	"*[45.2:2]Well, let's hope this assessment is correct,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_12
	"*[47.3:4]as all our senior commanders are now fighting in Europe."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_13
	"*[51.2:1.9]Leaving the defense of Great Britain"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_14
	"*[53.6:1.8]entirely in your hands."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_15
	"*[56.6:1.5]I'd like you to meet"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_16
	"*[58.4:1.3]Lieutenant Eva."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_17
	"*[60.1:3.3]She will be your intel officer and communications liaison."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_18
	"*[63.9:1.6]Glad to have you on-board, sir."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_19
	"*[66.9:2.3]Field Marshall, the president is ready for you."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_20
	"*[70.9:1.1]Mr. President."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_21
	"*[72.6:2.8]I'd like you to meet our new commander on the ground."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_22
	"*[75.8:1.3]Greetings, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_23
	"*[78.2:2.9]You ready to send those commies running back to their mommies?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_24
	"*[82.2:2.6]I sure hope so.  Because if you don't stop 'em over there,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_25
	"*[84.7:2.3]the only thing standing between those godless reds"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_26
	"*[87:2.3]and the U.S. of A. is gonna be one little ocean."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_27
	"*[89.7:2.8]I absolutely agree, Mr. President."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_28
	"*[92.5:3.4]We cannot allow the Soviets to secure a foothold in Great Britain."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS01_29
	"*[96.5:2.5]The fate of the free world depends upon it."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_01
	"*[2.1:2.1]Congratulations, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_02
	"*[4.7:2.3]You sent those bastards packing!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_03
	"*[7.5:3.5]They'll bloody well think twice before they try to invade us again."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_04
	"*[12:2.4]That was a win-win for everyone, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_05
	"*[14.8:2.9]Well, not the Reds. For them it was more of a lose lose."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_06
	"*[17.9:3]It's too bad our other commanders don't have your can do attitude."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_07
	"*[21.5:2]I'll tell you what, Bingham, I like this new commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_08
	"*[24:2.6]Let's send 'em to France so he can kick a little more Commie butt."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_09
	"*[27:4]Actually, sir, I was considering that very possibility."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_10
	"*[31.8:2]I guess great minds do think alike."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_11
	"*[34.3:5.1]And just to show you I'm not all talk, I'm sending you our toughest, meanest covert commando."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_12
	"*[40:2.2]Boys, I'd like you to meet...Tanya."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_13
	"*[42.2:0.9]Hello, gentlemen."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_14
	"*[43.3:1.7]Tanya's the best we have."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_15
	"*[45.3:3.4]She can kill a man fifteen different ways with her bare hands. So a word of advice."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_16
	"*[49:1.3]Don't get on her bad side."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_17
	"*[51:4.3]Commander, the Soviet General you beat back at Brighton Beach has retreated to the south of France."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_18
	"*[55.5:2.4]He captured Cannes and kidnapped all our brass down there."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS02_19
	"*[58.1:3]I'll take out their naval port, but you'll have to take care of the rest."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_01
	"*[1:1.1]Good job, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_02
	"*[2.3:4.2]The Allied leaders have been liberated and you've driven the Soviet army out of France."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_03
	"*[6.9:4.3]Tanya is currently working undercover and acquiring the latest intel on the situation."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_04
	"*[13:3]If I knew anything, I would tell you!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_05
	"*[16.1:0.7]Tanya!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_06
	"*[17.7:0.9]Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_07
	"*[19:1.2]Lieutenant Eva!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_08
	"*[21.7:2.7]Out here in the field things get a little messy sometimes."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_09
	"*[24.4:2.7]Not so neat and tidy like they are back in the office."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_10
	"*[28:2.4]Can you please brief the commander on our current situation?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_11
	"*[30.7:0.6]Certainly."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_12
	"*[31.6:1.5]The Reds hold Heidelberg."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_13
	"*[33.1:2.9]I'm gonna get Sergei here to give up the location of their headquarters."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_14
	"*[36:2.6]The only thing I can't do is take it out for you."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_15
	"*[38.7:2.8]That you're gonna have to do on your own."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS03_16
	"*[43.9:1.3]Njet! Please! (cut off)"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_01
	"*[15.4:3.1]The day of destiny has arrived."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_02
	"*[19.5:3.8]The Empire of the Rising Sun has risen."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_03
	"*[23.6:4.2]The western barbarians will bow before us…"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_04
	"*[28.2:3.3]or their nations will cease to exist."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_05
	"*[31.9:3.3]This message was broadcast throughout the world earlier today."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_06
	"*[35.2:3.8]Allied leaders have gathered in Geneva for an emergency meeting."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_07
	"*[39.3:4.5]The Empire's Floating Island Fortress currently controls the North Atlantic,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_08
	"*[44.1:3.9]blockading the entire continent of Europe, paralyzing all-"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_09
	"*[49.3:2]This is unbelievable!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_10
	"*[52.4:6.5]While we were busy fighting the red menace, this Empire of the Rising Sun was secretly preparing for war!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_11
	"*[59.4:4.2]They waited until we and the Soviets were at our weakest and most vulnerable and now…"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_12
	"*[64.5:2.5]now they are at our very doorstep!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_13
	"*[67.6:6.3]As you can see, it's not just our problem. The Soviets have also been blocked by these naval monstrosities."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_14
	"*[74.3:5.8]So... some of our diplomats have been in negotiations with them regarding a cease fire,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_15
	"*[80.3:4.1]as it's clear that neither one of us can defeat this new enemy alone."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_16
	"*[86.3:3.6]Bingham, I heard a crazy rumor that I know can't possibly be true..."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_17
	"*[89.6:1.8]What rumor are you referring to?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_18
	"*[91.6:3]That we're negotiating a peace treaty with the Commies?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_19
	"*[94.6:2]Actually it's more of a ceasefire."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_20
	"*[97.1:1.5]So you're telling me it is true?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_21
	"*[98.9:4.1]Well, we've already exhausted all of our forces pushing the Russians out of Europe."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_22
	"*[103.4:1.9]And now that we have a common enemy..."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_23
	"*[105.2:1]Bullpucky!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_24
	"*[106.4:3.3]You know those Russians can't be trusted. They hate everything we stand for."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_25
	"*[110.1:3.6]Freedom, liberty, the pursuit of happiness... apple pie…"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_26
	"*[114.3:1.2]did I say freedom?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_27
	"*[115.7:1.8]Well it's worth saying again!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_28
	"*[119.4:3.5]The leaders of all the other Allied nations already agreed--"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_29
	"*[122.3:0.7]Not me!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_30
	"*[123.2:1.7]Not the U.S. of By God A!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_31
	"*[125.2:3.2]You're making a very big mistake, my friend, you mark my words!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_32
	"*[135.2:5.1]The Empire believes it is their divine destiny to wipe us off the face of the earth."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_33
	"*[142.1:1.8]Prove them wrong, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_34
	"*[145.2:3.5]Commander, we're heading to Gibraltar to reclaim our port from the Japanese."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_35
	"*[148.9:2]I'm gonna be helping you out on the ground on this one."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_36
	"*[151.1:1.9]If I were you though, I'd watch your back."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS04_37
	"*[153.4:2.6]I trust these reds about far as I can throw 'em."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_01
	"*[0.3:3.2]Good show, Commander, bloody well done!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_02
	"*[3.6:6]Those Assault Destroyers you just reclaimed are going to be very useful in taking down those Island Fortresses."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_03
	"*[10.4:2.3]Sir! Premier Cherdenko is on the line."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_04
	"*[12.5:1.6]Put him through, Lieutenant. Gentlemen."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_05
	"*[14.5:1.7]Field Marshal Bingham,"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_06
	"*[16.4:5.9]I wanted to personally thank you for all your efforts in making this partnership successful."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_07
	"*[22.3:3.2]Well that's appreciated, but you should thank our commander here."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_08
	"*[25.6:2.5]He's the one who led the assault on Gibraltar."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_09
	"*[28.1:2.2]It is indeed a pleasure, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_10
	"*[31:4.7]I hope you were satisfied with Natasha's contribution on the battlefield."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_11
	"*[36.6:1.7]She's one of our finest."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_12
	"*[38.3:4]Yes, well, we're going to need Natasha and every other resource at your command"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_13
	"*[42.4:3.3]if we're going to take down that Floating Fortress in the North Atlantic."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_14
	"*[46:1]I concur."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_15
	"*[48.4:1.4]Good luck gentlemen."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_16
	"*[50:0.8]Thank you."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_17
	"*[52.3:4]This menace has put a choke hold on all naval movement in the North Sea."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_18
	"*[56.9:4.9]But with our Assault Destroyers and the help of the Soviets, we might just have a chance."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS05_19
	"*[63:1.6]Godspeed, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_01
	"*[0.8:4.1]That was bang on brilliant, commander! Excellent work!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_02
	"*[5:4.3]And I have to say, the Soviets are proving to be a valuable ally."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_03
	"*[10:2.3]Sir, Premier Cherdenko is on the line."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_04
	"*[12.5:0.8]He says it's urgent."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_05
	"*[14.2:3.7]We won't stand for this treachery, Bingham! Do you hear me?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_06
	"*[18.3:3.7]My advisers warned me against trusting you \"Allies\"."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_07
	"*[22:2]I'm sorry? Treachery?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_08
	"*[25.1:2.7]What the hell is going on? Eva?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_09
	"*[28.3:4.3]Sir, apparently one of our satellite relay systems is targeted directly at Moscow."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_10
	"*[33.2:3.1]It's source is an American command post I didn't even know existed."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_11
	"*[36.7:3] It's at the site of the Mount Rushmore monument in South Dakota."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_12
	"*[40:0.8]What?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_13
	"*[42.1:1]Ackerman."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_14
	"*[44:1.8]Get the president on the line."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_15
	"*[46.7:4.1]What's happening at this Mount Rushmore command center, Mr. President?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_16
	"*[51.2:2.6]Those reds are playing you for a fool, my friend."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_17
	"*[54:4.8]And as long as I'm the President of these United States, I can't allow them to lead this dance."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_18
	"*[59.3:2.5]Bingham, you can thank me later when this is all over."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_19
	"*[61.8:2.3]When what is all over?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_20
	"*[64.4:0.9]Ackerman!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_21
	"*[66.1:1.4]Oh, God."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_22
	"*[67.8:1.3]He's clearly out of his tree!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS06_23
	"*[69.2:3.9]You need to stop him Commander, before he undermines our alliance with the Russians!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_01
	"*[3.6:1.5]Ah, Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_02
	"*[6.2:1.3]That was a close one."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_03
	"*[8:2.1]I can assure you, we did the right thing."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_04
	"*[10.5:3.5]Ackerman put the whole world in danger with that mad stunt."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_05
	"*[14.3:3.9]And all the while, we're at war with the Empire of the Rising Sun!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_06
	"*[20.2:5.8]Sir... I just received word from an inside source that the Supreme Shogunate will be meeting in Tokyo tomorrow."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_07
	"*[26:2.9]So the Empire's generals will all be in one place at one time?"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_08
	"*[28.9:2.5]Yes, sir! We can decapitate them with one stroke."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_09
	"*[31.5:5.4]Brilliant! We must get on this immediately. I'll contact the Soviets and let them know the good news."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_10
	"*[37.8:2.3]Commander, this might be it."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_11
	"*[40.7:5.3]Let's show the Empire of the Rising Sun that their divine destiny of world domination"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_12
	"*[46.5:3]is nothing but an insane fantasy!"
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_13
	"*[51:2.2]I'm glad to see you made it back in one piece, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_14
	"*[53.6:2]Excellent job at Mount Rushmore."
End

SUBTITLE:AFS07_15
