	"[1.7:4.4]The Shogun Executioner has arrived and will help you with the destruction of the Kremlin."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH10
	"[3.2:3.3]The reports here indicate that the Shogun Executioner is… offline.[6.7:4.3]Don’t worry. The battle is not lost. Victory lies before you!"
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH11
	"[1.5:3.7]The Soviets that defend the Time Machine must perish at all costs.[5.6:4.8]You now have access to build the most destructive weapon in the Empire’s arsenal:[10.8:2.1]The Psionic Decimator."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH12_01
	"*[0.6:3.1]I can't wait to see this whole corrupt city in flames!"
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH12_02
	"*[4:3.1]Isn't the slaughter worth a little collateral damage?"
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH13_01
	"*[1.2:3]The Shogun Executioner is indeed a thing of beauty."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH13_02
	"*[4.6:3]But we should be ready to protect it if necessary."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH14_01
	"*[0.8:3.8]The Soviets were kind enough to die and leave us their resources."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH14_02
	"*[4.7:2.1]Is it the right time to expand?"
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH15_01
	"*[0.9:3.3]The destruction of the Soviets will surely please the Emperor."
End

SUBTITLE:J08TH15_02
	"*[4.7:4.8]I must admit, you've actually impressed me, commander. Sayonara."
End

SUBTITLE:J09MM01
	"[1.9:1.6]They tried to destroy us![3.4:5.5]But the Empire of the Rising Sun still stands. Finish them, once and for all![8.9:4.5]The Future-Tech research center must be razed to the ground!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH01_01
	"*[0.8:4.5]You might have pushed us back this far, but we'll do whatever it takes to defeat you."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH01_02
	"*[5.4:3]Prepare for the fight of your life!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH02_01
	"*[0.7:3.9]You'd better have something more than this if you hope to have a chance!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH03_01
	"*[0.5:4.6]You, Empire of the Rising Sun, you're a mistake out of time!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH03_02
	"*[5.6:4.1]You thought by destroying the Time Machine you could erase this error?"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH03_03
	"*[9.8:2.5]But I can still stop you!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH04_01
	"*[0.5:5.5]Argh! Where are the plans?! The Chronosphere's secrets of time displacement..."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH04_02
	"*[6.7:1.2]where are they?!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH05_01
	"*[0.4:5]No, don't come any closer! I need more time with the Chronosphere prototype!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH05_02
	"*[5.5:4.5]I won't hesitate to unleash catastrophe upon you!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH06_01
	"*[0.5:3.1]You monsters are forcing me to do this!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH06_02
	"*[3.9:3.9] I will re-create the Time Machine from these Chronosphere plans!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH06_03
	"*[8.4:1]All right!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH07_01
	"*[0.6:3.5]No…no! You are a mistake!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH07_02
	"*[4.3:3]My mistake… Argh!!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH08_01
	"*[0.5:2.1]Commander- you must push forward."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH08_02
	"*[2.6:3.8] I am giving you my most honored elite warriors."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH08_03
	"*[6.6:2.8]Use them to secure this victory."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH09_01
	"*[0.5:6.8]The shame that you have brought upon me with this failure will be endured by all of the Empire!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH09_02
	"*[7.5:4.9]Your ancestors will carry their heads low for eternity!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH10_01
	"*[0.5:4]For the glory of the empire, Commander- you must win!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH10_02
	"*[5.4:3.8]Make us proud- serve your Emperor!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH11
	"[1.6:4.3]We will need the Allied base destroyed before we can use our own aerial weaponry.[6:2.8]Good luck, and may honor find you."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH12
	"*[1.9:2.7]The Allies will not relent with their superweapons.[4.9:2.5]Protect your forces with the Nanoswarm."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH13
	"[1.9:1.6]They tried to destroy us![3.4:5.5]But the Empire of the Rising Sun still stands. Finish them, once and for all![8.9:4.5]The Future-Tech research center must be razed to the ground!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH14
	"[1.8:3.4]Nicely done! You have destroyed the Allied Air base![5.3:4.1]Now you have access to aerial forces. Use them wisely."
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH15
	"*[1.3:4.3]I look forward to finishing this quickly, and bringing this war to an end.[5.7:2.7]It is my honor to serve at your side!"
End

SUBTITLE:J09TH16
	"*[1:2.6]Would you like me to go after the superweapons?[3.8:1.8]I am ready for the order."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_01
	"*[58:3.7]Today is the day that destiny has promised us.[61.9:5.9]No longer will we suffer the abasement and the corruption of the foreign barbarians.[67.8:6.1]For as they battled among themselves, we have resurrected our realm,[73.8:3.9]creating a new Empire of the Rising Sun.[78.1:5.9]Commander, you are destined to reawaken Bushido, the way of the warrior.[84.4:7.4]You will be part of a new Shogunate, uniting powerful leaders from all four corners of our Empire.[92.2:9.4]Together we will first attack Soviet Russia and crush not only their armies, but their leaders, their spirit and their hope.[101.9:5.7]My son, Crown Prince Tatsu, will assist us in this noble endeavor.[108.4:4.5]Tatsu was instrumental in creating our new army--"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_02
	"*[113.4:1]Thank you, father...[114.4:3.2]Commander, our Nano-technology is second to none."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_03
	"*[117.5:6.6]Yes, but we must remember technology alone will not vanquish our enemies.[124.1:6.9]It will be our courage, our honor, and our self-sacrifice."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_04
	"*[131.3:5.7]Commander, allow me to introduce to you our chief logistical officer, Miss Suki Toyama."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_05
	"*[137:1.2]It is an honor.[138.6:4.2]The Toyama family has served the Emperor for ten generations!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS01_06
	"*[143.7:5.8]Yes, my father follows the ways of our ancestors and there is much wisdom in what he says.[149.7:3.9]But it is a new age, Commander. A new world.[154:3.1]Do what you must to be victorious!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_01
	"*[5.7:5.2]Commander, your bold victory has filled the Soviet people with fear.[11.2:3]Now we will strike at their very heart.[14.1:7.9]At Stalingrad. There stands a great monument that represents the unity and strength of the Soviet people.[22.1:2.4]It must be destroyed.[24.8:0.6]Tatsu?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_02
	"*[25.3:1.2]Yes, Father..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_03
	"*[27:3.7]Do you have our mechanized vehicles ready for deployment?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_04
	"*[30.6:2.2]Yes father, everything is set."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_05
	"*[32.7:4.9]Very well. We will need them to assault this great monument at Stalingrad."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_06
	"*[38.1:4.4]Monument? Our first launch of our mechanized army is to destroy a statue?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS02_07
	"*[42.6:4.8]We must follow the path fate has provided us. That is our destiny.[48:2.4]Crush the will of our enemies, Commander![50.4:3]Show them the way of the warrior!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_01
	"*[6.3:4.3]The will of the Soviet people hangs by a slim thread.[11.1:4.6]Our next attack will sever that thread like a katana's edge.[16.4:0.8]Tatsu![20.5:2]Tatsu!  Is it ready!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_02
	"*[22.5:1.2]Almost Father."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_03
	"*[23.7:1.8]We must strike Odessa now![25.6:3.7]While they are still reeling from the destruction of Stalingrad!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_04
	"*[29.3:1.2]I promise you.[30.5:3]We will level the city and eliminate the Soviet Supreme General.[33.5:3.3]Krukov is arrogant and brutal and it's time to bury him!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_05
	"*[37.2:3]I do not need General Krukov's death.[40.4:2.1]Only his obedience."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_06
	"*[42.5:3.2]If we bury him, we won't need his obedience!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_07
	"*[46.1:3.5]Wars are not won on the battlefield alone, my son,[49.7:4.4]but in the hearts and souls of our adversaries."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS03_08
	"*[57.1:2.1]I want their hearts and souls, commander,[59.5:2.3]but I also want Krukov's head on a stick![62.2:1.9]Eliminate the Supreme Soviet General.[64:1.8]Obliterate Odessa!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_01
	"*[0.8:5.9]Citizens of the world... The Empire of the Rising Sun has risen.[6.7:3.5]The day of our destiny has arrived.[10.6:3.7]Do not struggle against what is inevitable.[15:4.7]The Soviets resisted and suffered for their arrogance.[20.1:2.9]Do not make the same mistake.[23.3:5.4]Survival is not a matter of chance. It is a matter of choice.[29.1:3.2]Life or extinction?[32.2:1.9]It is up to you."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_02
	"*[35.3:2]You disapprove?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_03
	"*[41.6:4.8]Father, we should not have given the Allies the option of surrender.[47:3.8]We should have attacked without warning and annihilated them!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_04
	"*[50.9:2.5]They will not resist, my son.[54.1:3.5]Not after seeing our crushing of the Soviets."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_05
	"*[57.4:4.3]But father, we have intelligence from my spy, deep within the Allied command.[61.6:3.3]They are planning an attack on our base at Pearl Harbor!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_06
	"*[64.8:1]Pearl Harbor?![66.6:1.1]Impossible!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_07
	"*[68.2:0.9]Is it?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_08
	"*[69.2:2.7]It holds so many of our sacred shrines.[72.5:2.1]It houses half our fleet.[75.3:1.3]It would be foolhardy for them to--"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_09
	"*[76.6:2.5]You do not understand how they think, father.[79.3:3.7]The Allies believe we are inferior to them. They always have.[83.3:3.1]That is why we must show them no mercy."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS04_10
	"*[88:3.5]Then do what needs to be done.[92.2:2]Bolster our defenses.[95:3.1]Prepare for the attack on Pearl Harbor!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_01
	"*[1.1:1.4]Excellent work, Commander![2.5:2.7]It is now time to take the fight to the enemy.[5.9:1.7]Father, what is it?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_02
	"*[7.8:1.6]You have failed us!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_03
	"*[9.6:1.7]Failed us? We saved Pearl Harbor!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_04
	"*[11.2:5.1]Indeed and while you were focused on Honolulu, the enemy slipped through.[16.4:3.4]An Allied Naval force is on its way to Tokyo![19.7:5.6]The only thing between them and our homeland is a single Floating Island Fortress."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_05
	"*[25.4:4.1]They will never get past it. Father, we should continue to push forward! We should … we should …"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_06
	"*[29.4:2.5]And what if the fortress fails to stop them?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_07
	"*[32.3:0.7]Then…"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS05_08
	"*[33:1.6]Tokyo will be lost![34.9:4.5]No, we must defend that fortress and take out the Allied fleet.[39.8:3.4]Sweep all enemy forces from the South Pacific!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS06_01
	"*[13.6:4.4]Given enough time, any man may master the physical.[18.3:3.8]With enough  knowledge, any man may become wise.[22.3:4.3]It is the true warrior who can master both.[27.7:5.9]We have eliminated all opposition and have seized control of the Pacific Rim.[33.8:2.8]The time to strike is now. \n\n[37.2:3.9]Los Angeles is the hub of the Allied propaganda machine.[41.2:7.3]If we capture their centers of production, we take control of their hearts and minds.[48.4:5.8]Then, they will have no choice but to bend to our will."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_01
	"*[0:0]"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_02
	"*[4.2:3.8]Your android spy has proven very useful, my son."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_03
	"*[8.4:0.9]Thank you Father…"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_04
	"*[11.8:3]Is that the Soviet scientist talking to the Allies?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_05
	"*[19.9:3.3]Sir... I have developed a time machine."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_06
	"*[24.2:1.2]Is this some kind of joke?!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_07
	"*[25.4:3.3]We've confirmed this, Mr. President. He's speaking the truth."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_08
	"*[29.8:6]Well, the Soviet Union was on the brink of defeat and we ... we went back in time and changed everything!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_09
	"*[35.9:0.9]What are you saying?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_10
	"*[36.8:4.7]Well, we violated the space time continuum and forever changed the future!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_11
	"*[41.5:8]You see, the Empire of the Rising Sun never would have existed if not for our meddling with time and space!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_12
	"*[49.9:1.7]Mr. President, are you alright?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_13
	"*[53:2.5]Did he just say the Empire never would have existed?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_14
	"*[55.5:0.8]Mr. President..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_15
	"*[57.6:1.2]Mr. President!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_16
	"*[59.9:2.3]The Empire never would have existed?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_17
	"*[62.6:1.4]No…"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_18
	"*[67.7:2.8]If fate can be changed on a whim …"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_19
	"*[71:2.1]if the future is malleable ..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_20
	"*[73.1:2.5]then there is no divine destiny!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_21
	"*[76.2:2.3]All this means nothing!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_22
	"*[80:2.6]Mr. President, what do you propose we do?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_23
	"*[84.1:3]Oh my God. What the bloody hell!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_24
	"*[87.6:2.1]Our spy is no more…"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_25
	"*[95.1:1.3]General! Your highness!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_26
	"*[96.4:3.5] We are intercepting a flood of transmissions between the Allies and the Soviets."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_27
	"*[100.5:3.7]They are assembling a joint task force to attack our mainland!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_28
	"*[105.7:2.1]The Soviets and Allies together?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_29
	"*[110.5:2.1]We should have decimated the Soviet threat!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_30
	"*[112.9:2.7]We should have killed every last Allied soldier!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_31
	"*[116.3:1]I..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_32
	"*[118.5:1.7]I do not understand."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_33
	"*[122.3:2.3]I should have listened to you, my son."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_34
	"*[126.1:1.8]My time is done."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_35
	"*[130:1]Tatsu..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_36
	"*[132.2:3.8]I grant you full authority over the Shogunate."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_37
	"*[138.7:1]Please…"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_38
	"*[140.2:2.8]do not let the Empire fall."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS07_39
	"*[144.3:1.5]Yes, Father..."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS08_01
	"*[1.5:2.1]It is a new age, Commander.[4:2.8]Men and countries must make their own destinies.[6.9:3]We will now do what should have been done long ago.[10.2:4.3]We will annihilate the Soviet army and turn Moscow into rubble![14.9:2.4]You must find and destroy their time machine.[17.3:4.2]For if they change history again, they could end our lives ...[21.6:2.2]before we are even born."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_01
	"*[1.2:3.5]Thanks to you, Commander, the Soviet Union is no more.[5:2.4]Their failed philosophy is where it belongs.[7.4:2.1]In the dust bin of history."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_02
	"*[10.5:2.1]My son, I am proud of you."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_03
	"*[12.9:1.1]Thank you father."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_04
	"*[14.2:5.5]You have destroyed their time machine and restored the inevitability of our destiny."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_05
	"*[19.7:3.6]Actually father, I believe that we have made our own destiny."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_06
	"*[23.1:3]Perhaps the truth lies somewhere in between.[26.1:6.6]For you are the direct descendent of Emperor Jimmu, the spiritual luminary of the Samurai.[32.7:3.3]Master of Bushido. The Way of The Warrior."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_07
	"*[35.9:2]A man must have a code to follow."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_08
	"*[37.9:1.6]Indeed, my son."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_09
	"*[39.5:3.7]Will you join me, father? Will you help me to defeat our enemies?"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_10
	"*[43.2:1.8]It would be an honor."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS09_11
	"*[45.3:3.9]Commander, it is now time to vanquish all who would oppose[49.2:2.3]the Empire of the Rising Sun."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS10_01
	"*[17.2:1.5]Thank you, Commander![19.1:2.8]You have honored your ancestors."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS10_02
	"*[21.9:2.4]And defeated our enemies."
End

SUBTITLE:JFS10_03
	"*[24.6:5.6]Because of your victories, I bestow upon you the honored title of[30.5:2.5]Supreme Shogun!"
End

SUBTITLE:JFS10_04
	"*[49.4:2.7]Commander, I'm on the north shore of Oahu![52.1:1.2]Very beautiful...[53.3:1.5]very private![55.1:1.9]How would you like to join me?[56.9:3.8]Come on, Commander! Everyone needs to relax now and then...[60.8:1.5]even a Shogun!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKEDE1_01
	"*[0.9:3.8]I have disgraced my family and the emperor with this failure!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKEDE2_01
	"*[0.9:4.1]Looks like I'm out. Don't worry, you might still have a chance."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEDE3_01
	"*[0.9:2.4]That's it. They've finished me off."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEDE3_02
	"*[3.6:2.6]Don't you start crying on me now."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEGR1_01
	"*[0.8:4.6]Greetings, commander. I trust you'll be leaning heavily on my forces today."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEGR2_01
	"*[1:3.8]With me on your side, you'll surely have the advantage."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEGR3_01
	"*[0.8:5.3]Commander, once we're done here you'll have to join me at a little geisha bar I know about."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEND1_01
	"*[1.8:2]They're massacring my forces!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKEND1_02
	"*[4.2:1.8]Do you think this is funny!?"
End

SUBTITLE:JKEND2_01
	"*[0.9:4.7]I know this might sound unconventional, but... I think I need your help over here."
End

SUBTITLE:JKEND3_01
	"*[0.8:3.5]Whoa, I must have gotten them all riled up!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKEND3_02
	"*[4.7:2.3]Mind lending a hand while I'm still alive?!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETD1_01
	"*[1:1.8]Wait, what just happened…?"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETD1_02
	"*[3.1:3.9]This wet-nosed scrub beat me, just like that…?"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETD2_01
	"*[0.7:3.6]I have to admit. That was pretty good."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETD3_01
	"*[0.9:1.8]I bet you think this is funny!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETD3_02
	"*[3:2.6]Well I have friends you know."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG1_01
	"*[2.5:3]No need for formality, just call me Kenji."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG1_02
	"*[5.5:3.1]You might as well get comfortable for what's about to happen."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG2_01
	"*[0.8:2.3]Hey look, it's a noob in training!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG2_02
	"*[3.5:3.8]Tell you what, I'll keep one arm behind my back."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG3_01
	"*[1:3.8]I'm Kenji. And I am going to be your bully today."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETG3_02
	"*[5.1:3.6]First let's start off with a nice ripe spanking."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETV1_01
	"*[0.8:3.3]You should have stayed in bed and watched cartoons this morning."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETV2_01
	"*[0.7:2.6]Your technology was no match for mine!"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETV2_02
	"*[3.6:2.2]And neither are your looks, I'm afraid."
End

SUBTITLE:JKETV3_01
	"*[1.6:1.1]What was your name again?"
End

SUBTITLE:JKETV3_02
	"*[3.2:1.6]I like to keep a list going."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_01
	"*[0.6:4.3]Commander, you will be attacking a village on the north coast of the Soviet Union"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_02
	"*[4.9:1.9]that is revered by the Russian people."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_03
	"*[6.9:5]This town is next to a Soviet naval base capable of responding to our invasion."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_04
	"*[12.3:5.7]The village is in the midst of their New Year's Day celebration, so you'll catch them completely by surprise."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_05
	"*[18.3:4.4]Emperor Yoshiro wants us to destroy their Naval Yard, crush their spirit,"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB01_06
	"*[22.8:4.3]and turn this day of celebration into a day of mourning."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB02_01
	"*[0.8:3.9]The Soviets have a great monument to commemorate their military triumphs."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB02_02
	"*[5:3.4] It is a source of great pride and solidarity for their people."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB02_03
	"*[8.8:4.6]The Emperor believes that the destruction of this monument will break down their will"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB02_04
	"*[13.5:3.2]and show them that their defeat is inevitable."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB02_05
	"*[16.7:4.4]But beware, as these barbarians will not take this attack lightly."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB03_01
	"*[0.7:5.5]Oh Commander, this mission will make you the envy of all the Imperial Army."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB03_02
	"*[6.5:7]General Tatsu has created an awesome and terrifying weapon to help you take down General Krukov in Odessa."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB03_03
	"*[13.7:5]You must protect the weapon from the enemy's forces until it is operational."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB03_04
	"*[19:6.7]But once it is, the soldiers of the Soviet army will be running in fear."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_01
	"*[0.7:3.8]The Allies are attempting to take control of the Hawaiian Islands,"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_02
	"*[4.7:3.5]a sacred and strategically important part of our Empire."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_03
	"*[8.3:2.5]They think this will be a surprise attack."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_04
	"*[10.8:7.2]But General Tatsu has constructed a plan to flank the enemy and crush them with our mighty Battleships."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_05
	"*[18:4.5]You must protect Pearl Harbor and all our cultural treasures there."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB04_06
	"*[22.8:2.4]Drive them back into the sea!"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB05_01
	"*[1.2:4]The Allies foolishly continue to battle against what is inevitable."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB05_02
	"*[5.4:4.8]They are trying to slip a large naval force behind our lines to attack Japan."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB05_03
	"*[10.2:5]Fortunately, we have a Floating Island Fortress ready to intercept these savages."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB05_04
	"*[15.6:3.8] You must defeat the Allies to protect our homeland."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB05_05
	"*[19.7:4.1]Claim the Pacific for the Empire of the Rising Sun!"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB06_01
	"*[4:3.6]The invasion of Los Angeles is about to begin, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB06_02
	"*[7.6:6.5]The Emperor wants control of the American media centers to help broadcast his divine message across the world."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB06_03
	"*[14.2:5.4]We will take Westwood and Beverly Hills, and march all the way to Hollywood!"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB06_04
	"*[20.1:4.3]Oh, If you see any American movie stars, do me a favor."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB06_05
	"*[24.6:4.1]Before you kill them... can you get their autographs for me?"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB07_01
	"*[0.4:2.5]This is a dire situation, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB07_02
	"*[3.2:3.8]The Allies and Soviets have joined forces and taken most of Yokohama Harbor."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB07_03
	"*[7:3.5] You must re-recapture it and drive out our enemies."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB07_04
	"*[10.5:5.5]To help you in this endeavor, you will be granted the use of our psychic commando Yuriko."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB07_05
	"*[16:2.5]Do not fail us, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB08_01
	"*[0.6:5.1]The opportunity is here to destroy the Russian barbarians once and for all."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB08_02
	"*[6:3.1]The Shogun Executioner is heading towards the Kremlin."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB08_03
	"*[9.5:3.4]Help clear a path for it by destroying every enemy in the way."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB08_04
	"*[13.3:5.3]Supreme General Tatsu wants the Kremlin and its leaders obliterated."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_01
	"*[0.8:2.4]Our time has come, Commander."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_02
	"*[3.3:4.8]We have surrounded Amsterdam by sea, and you must lead the attack by destroying the Allies."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_03
	"*[8.7:3.8]Their headquarters must be taken out, as well as their source of weapons technology:"
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_04
	"*[12.5:2.4]The Future-Tech research center."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_05
	"*[15:3.8]They will attempt to defend the location and will fight to their last man."
End

SUBTITLE:JMB09_06
	"*[19:3.1]Lead us to victory, commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:JNADE01
	"*[1.1:3.1]The Shirada family has never known defeat.[4.9:2]I am disgraced."
End

SUBTITLE:JNADE02
	"*[1.2:3.2]I have failed you and I have failed the emperor!"
End

SUBTITLE:JNADE03
	"*[0.9:2.7]Do not let my defeat be for nothing![3.6:2.9]Make them pay for what they have done to me!"
End

SUBTITLE:JNAGR01
	"*[1.1:1.2]Naomi here.[2.5:2.2]My Imperial fleet is unmatched.[4.9:2]You should make the most of it."
