	"*[1.8:5.6]The Emperor is no more, and the whole Empire will now topple without their leader."
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH08_02
	"*[7.5:4.5]This was a great victory and a great day for all Soviets!"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH09
	"*[0.8:5.7]This is the type of battle I've been waiting for- where I get to kill someone important![7:2.8]I'll be going after the enemies on the ground."
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH10
	"*[0.9:4.4]Need me to focus my attacks on a different target? Just let me know."
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH11_01
	"*[1.1:2.5]Your presence here is an abomination."
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH11_02
	"*[4.1:4]I will destroy you barbarians in the name of the Emperor!"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH12_01
	"*[0.5:1]My Emperor-"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH12_02
	"*[2.2:1.7]I have failed you…"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH13
	"*[1.4:2.3]You fight without balance.[4.1:4.9]Watch me, and you may understand what it takes to be a commander."
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH14
	"*[1.6:1.6]I die with honor...[3.6:1.6]You will not!"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH15
	"*[1.5:5.8]Did you really think you could walk in here and insult the Emperor with your army of circus rejects?"
End

SUBTITLE:S07TH16
	"*[1.4:1]Who are you?![2.7:2.1]This wasn't supposed to happen!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_01
	"*[2.7:1.6]Thank you commander"
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_02
	"*[4.6:3.8]for so thoroughly and brutally dispatching my enemies."
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_03
	"*[8.8:1.5]But now, I'm afraid,"
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_04
	"*[10.6:2.8] you have outlived your usefulness."
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_05
	"*[14:7.5]You know just enough to be a threat to me and, with that, the future of the Soviet Republic."
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_06
	"*[21.6:3.3]I will not say dasvedanya, commander,"
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_07
	"*[25.8:1.7]as I can assure you,"
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM01_08
	"*[28.7:4.4]we will never meet again."
End

SUBTITLE:S08MM02
	"[4.5:3.2]I do not understand! The premier has gone mad![8:2.1]My loyalties lie with you, Commander.[10.1:3.8]For the good of the Soviet people, you must defeat him."
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH01_01
	"*[0.5:2.9]You didn't think we'd fall for your little ploy did you?"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH01_02
	"*[3.4:4.5]We came to this summit with our weapons loaded and our safety's off!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH02_01
	"*[0.3:2.9]I don't think you've got the mustard to win this one."
End

