	"*[0.5:2.9]Commander, I have a surprise for you."
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH04_02
	"*[3.5:3.3]I'd like to introduce you to my new toy:"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH04_03
	"*[7.3:1.8] the Tesla Tank!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH05_01
	"*[0.4:4]I'm sorry, Commander, but nothing will stand in my way,"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH05_02
	"*[4.7:2.6]especially not a fool like you!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH06_01
	"*[0.6:3.1]No! I must have victory!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH06_02
	"*[4:4.5]I am the Premier…this is MY timeline!"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH07
	"*[1.3:4.2]Comrade, the Allies will rely on their fleet to defend themselves here.[5.5:2.8]I'll keep an eye on this, and cover the coastline."
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH08
	"*[1:4.3]We will need strong artillery if we are to reach this weapon."
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH09
	"*[1:2.1]The decision is yours, Commander.[3.4:2.6]Should I concentrate on destroying this new weapon,[5.9:3.2]or continue keeping this madman at bay?"
End

SUBTITLE:S08TH10
	"*[1.1:2.1]I will be returning to Moscow now.[3.5:4.3]But push on, Comrade, and make your country proud!"
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH01_01
