End

SUBTITLE:S09TH07_01
	"*[0.7:3.3]You've done it! The Allies are vanquished!"
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH07_02
	"*[4:6.5]Thanks to you, commander, the entire world will now become the single greatest Soviet Republic!"
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH08_01
	"*[1:6.3]There is one final blow to deliver to the Allies: their hollow symbol of freedom."
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH08_02
	"*[7.3:4]Destroy the Statue of Liberty so that we may erect our own Monument."
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH08_03
	"*[11.3:4.8]This will let the world know that the communist revolution has finally come to pass."
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH09
	"*[0.9:3.4]We find ourselves on the doorstep to greatness.[4.5:4.7]And I just knew the path would lead to tearing apart these Allied swine![9.7:2.9]This will be my finest hour, Comrade."
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH10
	"*[0.9:1.9]I can try to clear the way to the statue.[2.9:2]Let me know when you want me to start."
End

SUBTITLE:S09TH11
	"*[1.4:5.1]That was the most fun I’ve ever had, and how the world trembles at our feet.[7.1:4]You should return home, I have a feeling you will be given a hero’s welcome.[11.8:4.1]I think I’m going to stay here, however, and have a bit more…[17.2:0.9]fun."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_01
