	"*[296.8:0.9]What Empire?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_63
	"*[297.8:2.3]The Empire of the Rising Sun, of course."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_64
	"*[300.9:2.7]We now have two mortal enemies?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_65
	"*[303.7:3.5]We must unleash our nuclear weapons! Annihilate them all!"
End

