	"*[312:2]Our nuclear weapons? Our atomic bombs!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_68
	"*[314:1]Oh don't you understand?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_69
	"*[315:5.5]Without Einstein, there is no nuclear weapons because we have altered the space time continuum!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS00_70
	"*[321.2:3.7]Who knows what nightmares we have created..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_01
	"*[9.9:1.6]Ah, Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_02
	"*[12.1:4.3]As you can see, our situation is shockingly grim."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_03
	"*[17.1:4.9]All our divisions are concentrated in Europe, pushing the Allies west."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_04
	"*[23:5]This \"Empire\" knows very well that we're vulnerable right now."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_05
	"*[28.3:3]They will be expecting us to fall swiftly."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_06
	"*[32:6]At this very moment, their invasion force moves relentlessly towards Leningrad."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_07
	"*[38.6:5.8]I have chosen you to defend the U.S.S.R. in this difficult hour,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_08
	"*[44.4:4.1]because I need a commander who does not believe in defeat!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_09
	"*[49.1:6.4]Someone who will not simply drive our enemies back, but ultimately annihilate them,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_10
	"*[55.8:1.4]humiliate them,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_11
	"*[57.2:2.8]and show them no mercy!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_12
	"*[65:4.9]General Krukov! Would you like to meet our new commander?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_13
	"*[70.2:1.1]New commander?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_14
	"*[71.3:4.5]Yes! We're sending him to protect Leningrad."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_15
	"*[75.8:3.4]Even though I told you it was foolhardy to try and defend that city?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_16
	"*[80.1:5.4]If Leningrad falls,  the Soviet people will begin to lose hope."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_17
	"*[85.9:3]Yes, well, I wish him luck then!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_18
	"*[89.3:4.3]The Empire's technology is highly-advanced and he will likely be vastly out-numbered."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_19
	"*[93.7:4.8]But of course, it is an honor to sacrifice one's life for the motherland, is it not?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_20
	"*[98.7:1.3]Indeed."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_21
	"*[100.5:2.9]Now if you'll excuse me, I have a nation to defend!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_22
	"*[104.7:6.4]Comrade Dasha will be your information officer and will coordinate all our communication."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_23
	"*[111.3:5.8]Thank you, your excellency. Commander, the armies of the Empire are closing in as we speak."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_24
	"*[118.6:1.5]Make haste, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS01_25
	"*[121.3:2.8]Time is of the essence!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_01
	"*[1:3.6]Very impressive, Commander.  Clearly you are quite resourceful."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_02
	"*[4.7:6.4]Yes, too bad Leningrad was merely a diversion meant to pull our forces from where they were actually needed."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_03
	"*[11.3:2.7]Maybe next time your efforts will be of more use."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_04
	"*[14:4.4]General, I've just been notified that the Imperial forces are moving towards Moscow."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_05
	"*[18.5:4]They are currently nearing our old satellite launch facility at Krasna-45."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_06
	"*[23.4:4.1]Krasna-45? We might be able to use that facility against them…"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_07
	"*[28.1:4.3]You see commander, while you were hiding behind the barricades in  Leningrad,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_08
	"*[32.4:4]our enemy was thrusting deeply into the motherland's tender nether regions."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_09
	"*[37.2:3.8]It's time to show some backbone and take the fight to the enemy."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS02_10
	"*[41.3:3]Stop them before they get any closer to Moscow!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_01
	"*[3.6:2.1]Another victory, commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_02
	"*[6.1:3.2]I knew my faith in you was not misplaced!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_03
	"*[12.2:1]General."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_04
	"*[13.3:3.1]We have pushed the Empire out of much of the motherland,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_05
	"*[16.6:2.5]but we will never win this war without our navy."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_06
	"*[19.5:2.5]We need to recapture our port at Vladivostok."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_07
	"*[22.3:3.5]Why don't we assign the young commander to that task?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_08
	"*[25.8:1.8]Don't be ridiculous Cherdenko!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_09
	"*[27.6:2]The Empire has a massive force there!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_10
	"*[29.6:2.4]This is not an operation for a novice."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_11
	"*[32.7:2]We need someone with vast experience."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_12
	"*[34.7:4]I have full confidence that the commander will be victorious."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_13
	"*[38.7:1.7]I don't share your confidence."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_14
	"*[41.2:5.2]I appreciate your points of view, General, but this is not your decision."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_15
	"*[46.4:3.9]Yes, you have made that...quite clear."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_16
	"*[56:3.9]Commander, the general was correct about one thing."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_17
	"*[60.5:3.9]We need our Navy if we are going to win this war."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS03_18
	"*[64.7:4.9]Destroy the Imperial forces occupying our port!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_01
	"*[0.1:1.5]My fellow Americans,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_02
	"*[2.4:3.7]I am humbled that you have chosen me to be your new President."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_03
	"*[6.7:5.6]And I am honored to lead our country forward during these dark and dangerous times."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_04
	"*[13.2:2.6]The Soviet Union's recent push into Europe"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_05
	"*[16.1:2.4]threatens our very existence as a nation."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_06
	"*[19.6:3.5]We've deployed troops and equipment to our European allies,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_07
	"*[23.2:2.8]but we haven't yet fully committed to this fight…"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_08
	"*[26.6:0.9]until now."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_09
	"*[29:5.5]I've introduced a bill which will quintuple the resources we are putting towards this conflict."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_10
	"*[35.6:6.9]Today I say it is time for America to take a stand against the scourge that is Godless communism!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_11
	"*[43.4:1.8]For if we don't, if we wait,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_12
	"*[45.7:2.6]soon, very soon..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_13
	"*[48.9:1.3]it will be too late."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_14
	"*[54:3.8]We finally get a taste of victory and now this!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_15
	"*[58.3:6.7]The new American President is an ignorant fanatic who wants to wipe us off the face of the Earth."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_16
	"*[65.5:4]He has rallied the allies and re-energized their will."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_17
	"*[70:4.7]We must strike swiftly, before they can mobilize their forces."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_18
	"*[75.7:1.4]Are you ready General?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_19
	"*[77.1:0.8]Of course!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_20
	"*[78.5:5.2]Commander, we are hitting the central Allied command center at Geneva before they reinforce it."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_21
	"*[84:1.7] You will be leading the charge."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_22
	"*[85.9:3.5]And I will be following soon after with the full might of the Soviet Military."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_23
	"*[89.7:1]Dasvedanya!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS04_24
	"*[91.1:1.5]Bottoms up, Nikolai!"
End

