	"*[5:1.3]Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_02
	"*[7:3.7]once again, the motherland owes you a great debt."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_03
	"*[11:1.6]You can not be serious?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_04
	"*[13:1.3]We succeeded despite,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_05
	"*[14.4:2.5]not because of this so-called commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_06
	"*[16.9:2.8]And it's a good thing I arrived when I did! | That will be all General..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_07
	"*[19.8:7]He compromised the entire operation with his timid hesitation and he nearly cost us- (cut off): the whole battle! | That will be all!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_08
	"*[29.8:4.3]General Krukov has a tendency to overstep his authority."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_09
	"*[34.5:2.6]One day he will go too far..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_10
	"*[37.8:3.9]Right now, however, we have a much more dangerous issue to deal with."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_11
	"*[41.7:5]We have evidence that the Americans are very close to creating a new kind of super weapon."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_12
	"*[47.3:3.8]Commander, this is Doctor Gregor Zelinsky,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_13
	"*[51.4:3.2]possibly the greatest scientific mind of our time."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_14
	"*[54.7:3.2]No, there was another… far greater..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_15
	"*[58.3:4.4]Doctor, please, what can you tell  us about this new technology?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_16
	"*[63.1:7.2]Ah, well, It holds a very destructive power far beyond anything that we ever seen before."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_17
	"*[70.3:3.7]And you see, the Americans they don't- (cut off): realize | Thank you, Doctor--"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_18
	"*[74.6:7]Commander, I need you to take this technology away from them before they harness it and use it against us."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS05_19
	"*[82:2.7]Comrade Dasha will provide the details of..."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_01
	"*[5.2:1.9]My grandfather was a Cossack …"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_02
	"*[7.8:3.8]and we Cossacks are not so easy to kill!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_03
	"*[12.6:2.3]Glad to see you up and around, sir!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_04
	"*[15.3:1.4]Thank you, Dasha."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_05
	"*[17.7:2]It is good to be alive!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_06
	"*[21.3:4.1]I was just about to congratulate the commander on his last operation."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_07
	"*[25.6:6.5]The crisis has been averted and the advanced weapons technology is in our far more capable hands."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_08
	"*[32.5:1.9]I know you're in need of rest, sir,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_09
	"*[34.5:5.3]but I thought you should know, that the Allies' European forces have retreated north to their airbase in Iceland."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_10
	"*[40.5:1.1]Thank you, Dasha."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_11
	"*[43.4:3.1]It's finally time to clear Europe of the Allied threat."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_12
	"*[46.9:3.5]They will be defending this base with everything they have."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_13
	"*[50.8:3.8]I'll send General Krukov again to join you in this battle."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS06_14
	"*[54.8:7.5]And while you are mopping up the last of those capitalist pigs, I will root out the enemy within!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_01
	"*[2.8:2.9]Welcome back, General"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_02
	"*[7:0.9]Thank you."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_03
	"*[14:3]Yes, my friend, you have been promoted."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_04
	"*[17.2:5.1]I'm sure Krukov's treachery was as much as a shock to you as it was to me."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_05
	"*[22.9:7.3]As my most trusted senior officer, I need you now to lead our forces against those who would destroy us."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_06
	"*[30.9:4.5]Sir, we've detected Imperial forces still occupying some Soviet territories."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_07
	"*[35.5:1.5]Let's let them be."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_08
	"*[37.5:4.4]They will be nothing without their venerable leader... their Emperor."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_09
	"*[42.4:2.6]Attack Mt. Fuji, General."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_10
	"*[45.5:5]Show the Japanese people he is not a God, but flesh and blood."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_11
	"*[51.3:5.6]It is time for the Empire of the Rising Sun to set!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_12
	"*[61.5:2.7]General … things are not what they seem."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_13
	"*[64.5:4.7] When you hear what I have to say, you might believe I am out of my mind, but I speak truth."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_14
	"*[69.2:5.7]Now, listen, listen! I have created machine which allows man to travel through time."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_15
	"*[74.9:6.7]We have violated the space time continuum and the repercussions of this arrogant act have been catastrophic!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_16
	"*[82:6.7]Cherdenko should not have been premier, and the Empire of the Rising Sun would never have existed!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_17
	"*[88.7:4.6]No one knows about this except for you and me, Commander. My life is in great danger!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS07_18
	"*[93.8:4.6]You are a hero to the people, they will follow you if you show them the truth!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_01
	"*[3.4:2]Commander!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_02
	"*[6:4.7]First of all I want to congratulate you on such an important victory!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_03
	"*[11.8:7.8]The Empire of the Rising Sun has now joined the family of our glorious socialist republics!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_04
	"*[20.3:4.8]Though culturally they are a backward and superstitious people,"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_05
	"*[25.4:3.3]technologically they are quite advanced."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_06
	"*[29.1:7]Dr. Zelinsky has been delving into some of their secrets and I'm sure he has some interesting insights."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_07
	"*[36.6:1.6]Dr. Zelinsky?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_08
	"*[41.8:1.5]Dr. Zelinsky!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_09
	"*[45.1:1.3]Now where did he go?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_10
	"*[47.8:2.6]No matter...We have more work to do."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_11
	"*[51.7:4.8]It is time my comrade, to deliver the final blow to the Allied cause."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_12
	"*[56.8:4]You are to meet the Supreme Allied Commander at Easter Island."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_13
	"*[60.8:4.6]Together you will sign a treaty, calling for an end to all armed conflict."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_14
	"*[65.6:8.3]I have convinced them that we, as a nation, are weary of war and that our people only want peace."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_15
	"*[76.4:7]We will sign this treaty, we will come together as brothers, and then...we will crush them!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_16
	"*[85.1:1.3]Yes, General …"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_17
	"*[87.1:1.5]it is a trap …"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_18
	"*[89.1:2]and you, my friend …"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS08_19
	"*[91.5:2]are the bait."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_01
	"*[10.7:4.3]After all the battles you've won, and the dangers you've braved, how could he do this?"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_02
	"*[15.3:3.6]We now believe he was responsible for Dr. Zelinsky's disappearance."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_03
	"*[19.3:4.4] He also fabricated the attempt on his own life just so he could frame General Krukov!"
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_04
	"*[25:4.3]Destiny has placed the fate of the Soviet Union in your hands, commander."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_05
	"*[31.1:3.2]The Allies are still reeling from what happened on Easter Island."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_06
	"*[34.4:2.8]The last of them have retreated to the United States."
End

SUBTITLE:SFS09_07
	"*[37.3:6.6]Their president, who rallied the world against us, now stands alone defending his precious city of New York."
End

