SUBTITLE:SMB01_01
	"*[0.5:4.2]We know little about the Empire's invasion force other than that they are extremely mobile."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB01_02
	"*[4.8:3.9]They have surrounded Leningrad and are assaulting the city by way of the canals."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB01_03
	"*[9:4.3]Save our great metropolis; it is a symbol of the People’s Revolution."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB01_04
	"*[13.3:3]We’ve assigned the legendary sniper Natasha to your command."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB01_05
	"*[16.3:4.4]She will help you to help defend the city and eradicate the invading Imperial soldiers."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB01_06
	"*[21:1.3]Dasvedanya."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB02_01
	"*[0.7:3.1]All will be lost if the Empire's forces reach Moscow."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB02_02
	"*[3.8:3.9]We are going to use the Krasna-45 installation to intercept them."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB02_03
	"*[8.2:6.5]Even though it is inhabited by vagrants, the launch pad at Krasna-45 is still operational."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB02_04
	"*[15.2:4.8]General Krukov believes that we can use it against the enemy once the Satellite is in orbit."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB02_05
	"*[20.1:1.3]Good luck."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB03_01
	"*[0.7:6.9]The Empire seized the port of Vladivostok, which was, as you know, the former home of the Soviet Pacific fleet."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB03_02
	"*[7.9:6.2]In a further showing of arrogance, we have learned that the Emperor’s son has constructed an elaborate palace there."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB03_03
	"*[14.6:4.8]We must show them the meaning of Soviet pride and push them out of the motherland."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB03_04
	"*[19.5:4.4]Destroy this insulting palace and secure our coast."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB04_01
	"*[1:4.3]We must hurry and cripple the Allies before the American reinforcements arrive."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB04_02
	"*[5.3:3.8]Our main target is a key forward command center in Geneva, Switzerland."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB04_03
	"*[9.1:6.3]We need to take this base out before the newly funded Allies use it as a springboard to enter Soviet territory."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB04_04
	"*[15.8:3.2]The General will be joining you once you clear the way for him."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_01
	"*[0.9:1]Okay."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_02
	"*[3.8:2.6]Commander, I’m not sure what’s happening."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_03
	"*[6.7:2.3]There has been no word on the fate of the Premier."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_04
	"*[9:4.5]But as loyal soldiers of the U.S.S.R., we must stay strong and fight on."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_05
	"*[13.5:5.7]We have been victorious against the Allies thus far, but this new technology is of great concern."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_06
	"*[19.9:4.3]The Greek Island of Mykonos is where the Allies are researching this new technology."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB05_07
	"*[24.3:6.7]I do not pretend to understand the science behind it, but I know we must not let our enemies have it."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB06_01
	"*[1.1:4.1]The Allies' European forces have retreated to their Airbase in Iceland."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB06_02
	"*[5.5:6.9]This is their last station in Europe, but it is well armed and well fortified with the full might of the Allied Air Force."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB06_03
	"*[12.9:3.3]The General will be arriving once again to provide support,"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB06_04
	"*[16.3:5]and you will have access to the Iron Curtain to help protect your armor in combat."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB06_05
	"*[21.3:3]Lead our nation to victory, comrade."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_01
	"*[2:2.9]Congratulations on your promotion, General."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_02
	"*[4.9:5.1]As your first directive, the Premier demands the death of the Emperor Yoshiro."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_03
	"*[10.3:3.5]You must breach the Emperor’s Palace and make it past his elite guard."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_04
	"*[13.9:4.4]All of our military and technological resources will be at your disposal, General,"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_05
	"*[18.3:2.3]in this unprecedented air drop."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB07_06
	"*[20.7:1.2]Good luck."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB08_01
	"*[0.9:5.5]We have the Allies running scared, and now their General is willing to broker peace."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB08_02
	"*[6.9:2.7]They have shown weakness and we must exploit it."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB08_03
	"*[9.9:4.7]Meet them at the uninhabited Easter Island, and convince them that we are sincere."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB08_04
	"*[14.8:3]And when they have lowered their weapons and raised their glasses,"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB08_05
	"*[17.9:2]it is then that we will strike!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_01
	"*[1.3:2.3]We must take the battle to them, Comrade."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_02
	"*[3.6:3.7]We must assail the bastion of Capitalism and burn it to the ground!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_03
	"*[7.7:4.1] Liberate the people of New York City, and defeat the fascist overlords!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_04
	"*[12.2:5.4]But be careful, General, they can move their forces instantly with their Chronosphere technology."
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_05
	"*[18:1.9] The forces here are on high alert,"
End

SUBTITLE:SMB09_06
	"*[19.9:2.5]for they know that their day of reckoning has arrived…"
End

SUBTITLE:SMODE01
	"*[1:1.7]You have left me to die![3.4:2.8]I knew you I should've trusted you."
End

SUBTITLE:SMODE02
	"*[1.8:3.6]Are you a traitor?  Is that why you let me perish?"
End

SUBTITLE:SMODE03
	"*[1.5:1.5]They may have gotten me.[3.3:4.3]But you. YOU can still have victory!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOGR01
	"*[1.4:1.9]Commander Moskvin here, sir![3.3:3.8]Ready to eradicate all who stand in our way!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOGR02
	"*[1.3:2]Don't worry about a thing, commander.[3.7:3.3]Just tell me who should die, and I will do the rest."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOGR03
	"*[1.4:4]Today, you and I will exterminate the enemy together![5.8:2.4]This should be very enjoyable."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOND01
	"*[2.6:1.6]They're about to finish me off![4.2:2.4]Come on, Comrade! Please!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOND02
	"*[2.8:2.9]Do you not see what is happening over here, Comrade?[5.9:2]What are you waiting for?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOND03
	"*[1.9:2.9]If I'm wiped out, you do not stand a chance![5.4:2]You know this don't you!?"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTD01
	"*[1.5:2.6]I saw your little tricks that you just pulled.[4.8:2]Try them on me next time."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTD02
	"*[1.7:1.7]Beaten by you?!...[4:3.3]Who are you and where have you come from?"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTD03
	"*[1.4:4.3]I never would have lost were it not for the incompetence of my forces.[6.5:1.5]At least they're dead!"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTG01
	"*[1.8:3]Well look at what we have here![5.1:2.7]I will enjoy slaughtering your forces,[8.5:2.1]to the very last soldier."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTG02
	"*[2:3.9]They sent vermin like you to try and stop me?[7.6:1.6]What is this, a joke?"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTG03
	"*[1.8:2.4]Do you think you are prepared to fight me?[5:4.5]I will chew you up and spit you out, just like my mother's goulash."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTV01
	"*[1.6:3.1]Now look at what's become of you, commander.[5.1:2.6]Was all the bloodshed to your satisfaction?"
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTV02
	"*[1.6:3]Now go run off and cry to your mother![5.2:1.8]Moskvin will be waiting."
End

SUBTITLE:SMOTV03
	"*[1.6:5.2]Did your superiors not warn you about what would happen if you confronted me?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLDE01
	"[1.5:3.4]Goodbye my friend. We had some good times together."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLDE02
	"[1.4:2]My time has come, my friend.[3.8:1.4]It is up to you now![5.7:1.4]Make them pay!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLDE03
	"[1.6:1.2]I don't know what happened![2.9:2.6]Next thing I know they're taking out my whole base."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLDE04
	"[1.6:3.3]Chyort, they got me...[5.4:3.8]Don't let the sacrifices of my men be in vain, you hear?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLGR01
	"[1.7:2.2]Hey friend, It's Oleg.[3.8:2.3]Let's have some fun today, yes?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLGR02
	"[1.5:1.8]Hah, it's you![3.4:4.7]Once we wipe the floor with these pigs, let's catch up on some old times!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLGR03
	"[1.5:2.7]Commander Oleg is at your side, comrade.[4.2:3.7]Do not worry.  Victory will be swift!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLGR04
	"[1.6:1.3]It's you and me, friend.[2.9:3.4]Let's make this quick but painful for them, shall we?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLND01
	"[1.9:1.7]We can't hold out much longer![3.7:3]Comrade, it's time for us to join arms!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLND02
	"[1.7:2]They are destroying all my forces![3.7:1.6]Do you have a minute?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLND03
	"[1.6:2.1]Many of my men are dead, comrade![3.7:2.2]Next they will be coming for me!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLND04
	"[1.7:2.6]Things aren't looking so good for old Oleg...[4.5:2.1]Come on, help me out here will you?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTD01
	"[2.1:2.8]Hey, wipe that smirk off your face.[5.3:2]What? You've never lost before?"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTD02
	"[1.8:2.1]That was a good practice round.[3.8:2.6]Next time, it will be for keeps!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTD03
	"[1.9:3.3]To think I was defeated by a little goat like you…"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTD04
	"[2:2.4]No,no, no, this is impossible![4.8:1.5]How could I lose,[6.7:1]again?!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTG01
	"[1.9:3.3]You got a lot of nerve showing your face around here.[5.8:3.5]I wonder if anyone will still recognize it after I'm done."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTG02
	"[2:2.9]Ha, so you think you can take me?[5:1.5]You little monkey...[6.8:1.3]Bring it on!"
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTG03
	"[1.7:2.2]Why do they always send me the rookies?[4.7:2.9]Hold still, I'll make this quick."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTG04
	"[2.1:2.5]Well look at what the wind blew in.[4.8:3.4]Sit tight, my tanks will be with you shortly."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTV01
	"[2:4.5]Look, I can't just roll over and play dead. You gotta fight too, you know."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTV02
	"[2:3.9]I'm sure you were just going easy on me. I appreciate that."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTV03
	"[2.1:2.1]What, is that all you've got?[5:1.9]I heard you were better than this."
End

SUBTITLE:SOLTV04
	"[0.8]Let it be known that Oleg Vodnik defeated you this day! [5.0]Tell your friends about me!\n"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHDE01
	"*[1.1:2.8]I have failed you, and the people.[4.3:1.8]Dasvedanya, my brother!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHDE02
	"*[1.5:4.4]My forces may have been vanquished. But you still stand![5.8:2.2]Do not fail us, comrade!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHDE03
	"*[1.4:4.4]Please! Do not let my defeat be for nothing, comrade!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHGR01
	"*[1.1:1.9]Commander Zhana on duty.[3.1:5.1]Together we will prevail in the name of the Soviet Union!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHGR02
	"*[1.2:2.1]I am Zhana, Comrade.[3.3:6.3]My squadrons are at your beck and call and will sacrifice all for the glory of the revolution!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHGR03
	"*[1.4:1.2]Zhana here.[2.6:4.6]Comrade, our enemies do not stand a chance against both of us!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHND01
	"*[1.6:4.3]Comrade! If you are still loyal to the cause, come to my aid!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHND02
	"*[1.5:4.1]I cannot survive much more of this! I call for your assistance, comrade!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHND03
	"*[1.9:5.2]They have almost killed us all!  But I will fight until my last breath!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTD01
	"*[1.5:1.9]I have failed the motherland![3.7:3.8]I am prepared for whatever punishment this may have earned me."
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTD02
	"*[1.8:5.4]You may have defeated me, but my loyalty to the Union does not waver!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTD03
	"*[1.6:2.4]I am defeated and at your mercy.[3.9:3.4]Though I would expect none from one such as you."
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTG01
	"*[1.6:5.7]You may know me as Zhana, Commander of the most powerful Soviet airforce.[7.6:3.4]I will accept your surrender at any time."
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTG02
	"*[1.7:3.2]The power of the Soviet Union is unmatched![5.2:3.3]But that's why you’re here, isn't it?"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTG03
	"*[1.8:3.6]I have studied your dossier and know your tricks.[5.6:3.6]Do not be so foolish to think you know mine."
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTV01
	"*[1.8:4.9]Once again the might of the Soviet Union prevails!"
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTV02
	"*[1.8:3.9]I teach at a Soviet cadet school which is accepting applications.[5.6:1.8]You should consider it."
End

SUBTITLE:SZHTV03
	"*[1.9:2.1]Your arrogance was your downfall.[3.9:2.9]Next time perhaps you will show more respect."
End

SUBTITLE:TESTTITLECARD
	"This is a multi-line testTo Test the Title cardSupport. In the VideoSequencer."
End

